#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{aws} Image Preparation and Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕຽມຮູບພາບລະບົບ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers initial preparation and configuration of the image on "
"{aws}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບພາບລະບົບໃນ {aws}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IAM Role"
msgstr "ບົດບາດ IAM (IAM Role)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To ensure seamless operation, proper {aws} permissions for the IAM (Identity "
"and Access Management) role are essential.  This role must be attached to "
"the instance, otherwise disconnection errors will be thrown after one hour."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຂັດຂ້ອງ, ການກຳນົດສິດ {aws} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບບົດບາດ IAM (Identity and Access Management) ແມ່ນສິ່ງສຳຄັນ. ບົດບາດນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດເຂົ້າກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານໄປໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can pre-create the role on your {aws} account and then select it from "
"the existing btn:[IAM role] drop-down during the instance configuration "
"process."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງບົດບາດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນບັນຊີ {aws} ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກມັນຈາກລາຍການ btn:[IAM role] ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you create the role during the creation of an instance, the role will not "
"be attached automatically.  The role should be added post setup."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງບົດບາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ບົດບາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕິດໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຄວນເພີ່ມບົດບາດນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:7
msgid ""
"A role can be assigned to a running instance through the following steps: "
"menu:Actions[Security > Modify IAM-role].  It needs to have the following "
"policy attached in order to be used:"
msgstr "ບົດບາດສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕອນ: menu:Actions[Security > Modify IAM-role]. ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີນະໂຍບາຍ (policy) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕິດຢູ່ນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"AttachedPolicies\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"PolicyName\": \"AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\",\n"
"            \"PolicyArn\": "
"\"arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"AttachedPolicies\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"PolicyName\": \"AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\",\n"
"            \"PolicyArn\": \"arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSMarketplaceMeteringFullAccess\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:9
msgid "To allow the **EC2** service to assume such role:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບໍລິການ **EC2** ຮັບບົດບາດດັ່ງກ່າວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\"AssumeRolePolicyDocument\": {\n"
"            \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"            \"Statement\": [\n"
"                {\n"
"                    \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"                    \"Principal\": {\n"
"                        \"Service\": \"ec2.amazonaws.com\"\n"
"                    },\n"
"                    \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n"
"                }\n"
"            ]\n"
"        }\n"
msgstr ""
"\"AssumeRolePolicyDocument\": {\n"
"            \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"            \"Statement\": [\n"
"                {\n"
"                    \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"                    \"Principal\": {\n"
"                        \"Service\": \"ec2.amazonaws.com\"\n"
"                    },\n"
"                    \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n"
"                }\n"
"            ]\n"
"        }\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:11
msgid ""
"IAM role can be attached to an **EC2** instance by means of an instance "
"profile, which acts as a container for the role itself."
msgstr "ບົດບາດ IAM ສາມາດຕິດເຂົ້າກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ **EC2** ໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານ instance profile, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວບັນຈຸ (container) ສຳລັບບົດບາດນັ້ນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For detailed information on IAM roles, see: "
"link:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles.html[docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບບົດບາດ IAM, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: link:https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles.html[docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM]"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {productname} Instance"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring your {productname} instance"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Select the AMI image and provide a meaningful **name** for your server.  "
"Review the details and pricing information provided."
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບພາບລະບົບ AMI ແລະ ຕັ້ງ **ຊື່** ທີ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍສຳລັບເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ. ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນລາຄາທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You have the option to configure additional instance details in subsequent "
"steps, such as storage, tags, security groups, and the required **IAM "
"role**."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີທາງເລືອກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍລະອຽດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ ເຊັ່ນ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (storage), ແທັກ (tags), ກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ (security groups), ແລະ **ບົດບາດ IAM** ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:17
msgid "The image automatically suggests a **default CPU configuration**."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບລະບົບຈະແນະນຳ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ CPU ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ** ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Choose an existing key pair or create a new one to grant access to the "
"instance."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄູ່ກະແຈ (key pair) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Your organization should provide the necessary security groups and network "
"configuration."
msgstr "ອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈັດຕຽມກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄວ້ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If an IAM role has been previously created, you can attach it by selecting "
"it from the existing menu:IAM role[] drop-down.  Otherwise, attach this role "
"after the instance has been launched."
msgstr "ຖ້າບົດບາດ IAM ຖືກສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ menu:IAM role[]. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຕິດບົດບາດນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:21
msgid "Create the following partitions"
msgstr "ສ້າງພາດທິຊັນ (partitions) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "**100 GB** for the root partition\n"
msgstr "**100 GB** ສຳລັບ root partition\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "**500 GB** for spacewalk storage\n"
msgstr "**500 GB** ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ spacewalk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "**80 GB** for the database.\n"
msgstr "**80 GB** ສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For more information see: "
"xref:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc[AWS "
"requirements]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: xref:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc[ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງ AWS]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:26
msgid "Follow the prompts from AWS to complete the configuration as needed."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຈາກ AWS ເພື່ອສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:27
msgid "After reviewing your configuration click the btn:[Launch instance] dropdown."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch instance]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:28
msgid "Click on the btn:[Launch Instances] button."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch Instances]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:29
msgid "You will be redirected to the **EC2** Dashboard."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໜ້າ **EC2** Dashboard."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Verify that the instance has successfully launched by selecting "
"menu:Instances[] on the left sidebar.  The {productname} {payg} instance "
"should be running in the main content area."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ໂດຍການເລືອກ menu:Instances[] ຢູ່ແຖບດ້ານຊ້າຍ. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຄວນຈະກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:31
msgid "[NOTE]"
msgstr "[ໝາຍເຫດ]"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:32
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage and Costs"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-configure-the-image.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Because this is a {payg} image, you will be billed according to your actual "
"usage, including the number of systems you **manage** and **monitor** with "
"this instance.  It is essential to regularly track and review your usage to "
"prevent unexpected costs and ensure alignment with your needs."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບພາບລະບົບແບບ {payg}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຮຽກເກັບເງິນຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຈິງຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານ **ຈັດການ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມກວດກາ** ດ້ວຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting {payg} Clients and Client Registration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ {payg} ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Connections and Registering {payg} and {byos} images"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນຮູບພາບລະບົບ {payg} ແລະ {byos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{payg} ({payglongform}) Images:: Connecting and registering {payg} images is "
"supported and can be done without additional prerequisites."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບລະບົບ {payg} ({payglongform}):: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນຮູບພາບລະບົບ {payg} ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{byos} ({byoslongform}) Images:: Registering {byos} images requires {scc} "
"({scclongform}) credentials beforehand.  If a user attempts to onboard a "
"{byos} image without providing {scc} credentials, the operation will fail, "
"as these credentials are required to verify your subscription."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບລະບົບ {byos} ({byoslongform}):: ການລົງທະບຽນຮູບພາບລະບົບ {byos} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {scc} ({scclongform}) ກ່ອນ. ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ພະຍາຍາມນຳເອົາຮູບພາບລະບົບ {byos} ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc}, ການດຳເນີນການຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ເພາະວ່າຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການຢືນຢັນການລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Always verify the type of image ({payg} or {byos}) prior to initiating the "
"registration process with {productname} to ensure a smooth and error-free "
"connection."
msgstr "ກວດສອບປະເພດຂອງຮູບພາບລະບົບ ({payg} ຫຼື {byos}) ທຸກຄັ້ງ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ສະດວກ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have {scc} credentials ensure your {scc} credentials are valid and "
"have the necessary permissions for utilizing {byos} images."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນຍັງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ ແລະ ມີສິດທິທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການນຳໃຊ້ຮູບພາບລະບົບ {byos}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Do not** register {payg} instances with the {scclongform}.\n"
"Only {byos} instances should be registered against the {scclongform}.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ຫ້າມ** ລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ກັບ {scclongform}.\n"
"ສະເພາະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄວນລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Registering {payg} instances with the {scclongform}  or your own RMT "
"server will create conflicts that are not easily solved**.  \n"
"{payg} instances are automatically registered against the correct update "
"server when added to your cloud service provider {productname} instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ການລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ເຊີເວີ RMT ຂອງທ່ານເອງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຍາກ**. \n"
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີອັບເດດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting Up Additional {payg} {suse} Products in {aws}"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ແບບ {payg} ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:10
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information on using {suse} {payg} products such as {sle} in the "
"public cloud see: "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ແບບ {payg} ເຊັ່ນ {sle} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: link:https://documentation.suse.com/sle-public-cloud/all/html/public-cloud/cha-intro.html[SUSE Linux Enterprise Public Cloud Guide]"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establishing a {payg} {sle} Connection with {productname} {payg}"
msgstr "ການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {sle} ແບບ {payg} ກັບ {productname} {payg}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:12
msgid ""
"It is important to recognize that there is a difference between "
"**{payglongform} connections** and **bootstrapping**.  Bootstrapping is also "
"known as **client registration**."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າ ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payglongform}** ແລະ **ການບູດສະແຕຣັບ (bootstrapping)**. ການບູດສະແຕຣັບ ຍັງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ **ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ (client registration)**."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Once you have started up your {productname} {payg} instance and refreshed "
"products you can add **{payglongform} connections** via the menu:Admin[Setup "
"Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go] button.  This action links "
"your {productname} {payg} instance with additional {payg} products on {aws}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລະ ອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payglongform}** ຜ່ານປຸ່ມ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຂອງທ່ານກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ອື່ນໆໃນ {aws}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bootstrapping** or **client registration** is the process of onboarding "
"clients in {productname}. \n"
"The registration process installs the appropriate client tools and provides "
"full management functionality.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ການບູດສະແຕຣັບ** ຫຼື **ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ** ແມ່ນຂະບວນການນຳເອົາລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ {productname}. \n"
"ຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນຈະຕິດຕັ້ງເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນການຈັດການທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To manage your clients, start by **establishing connections** and then "
"proceed to **bootstrap** your clients.  These two actions are the steps "
"required for initiating and completing the client onboarding process."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍ **ການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່** ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນດຳເນີນການ **ບູດສະແຕຣັບ** ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ. ສອງການດຳເນີນການນີ້ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສຳເລັດຂະບວນການນຳເອົາລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Connecting {sle} {payg} Instances to {productname} {payg}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {sle} {payg} ກັບ {productname} {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:17
msgid "Return to the {productname} Server {webui}."
msgstr "ກັບໄປທີ່ {webui} ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:18
msgid ""
