#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial Preparation and Configuration of the {azure} Managed Application"
msgstr "ການຕຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {azure} Managed Application"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers initial preparation and configuration of the Managed "
"Application on {azure}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Managed Application ໃນ {azure}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring your {productname} instance"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There are two tabs you need to fill out: _Basics_ and _Virtual Machine "
"Settings_."
msgstr "ມີສອງແຖບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ: _Basics_ ແລະ _Virtual Machine Settings_."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fill Out the _Basics_ Tab"
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຖບ _Basics_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:6
msgid "Project Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດໂຄງການ (Project Details)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:7
msgid ""
"As with every resource in Azure, you need to provide a _Resource Group_ "
"(RG). This can be an existing RG or you can create a new RG for this "
"deployment."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບທຸກໆຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ Azure, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸ _Resource Group_ (RG). ນີ້ສາມາດເປັນ RG ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ RG ໃໝ່ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:8
msgid "Instance Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instance Details)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:9
msgid "Region – where the instance should run."
msgstr "Region – ພາກພື້ນທີ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຄວນເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:10
msgid "Virtual Machine Name – the name of the VM in which {productname} will run."
msgstr "Virtual Machine Name – ຊື່ຂອງ VM ທີ່ {productname} ຈະເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:11
msgid "Username – the administrator account for the {productname} VM."
msgstr "Username – ບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator) ສຳລັບ VM ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:12
msgid "SSH Key Source and Key – needed to access the machine."
msgstr "SSH Key Source ແລະ Key – ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:13
msgid ""
"We do not allow the use of a password here. This is to reduce the risk of "
"brute force attacks."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງຈາກການໂຈມຕີແບບ brute force."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:14
msgid "Managed Application Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດ Managed Application"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:15
msgid "Application Name – the name of the Managed Application."
msgstr "Application Name – ຊື່ຂອງ Managed Application."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Managed Resource Group (MRG) – where the {productname} VM and its resources "
"will be deployed into."
msgstr "Managed Resource Group (MRG) – ບ່ອນທີ່ VM ຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງມັນຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໄປ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to the _Virtual Machine Settings_ Tab"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແຖບ _Virtual Machine Settings_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:18
msgid "Instance Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instance Size)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The default for the instance size is _D8as v5_, which is a good baseline for "
"a production server. It provides enough resources for more data disks and "
"IOPS throughput for disk and network."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຂະໜາດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ແມ່ນ _D8as v5_, ເຊິ່ງເປັນລະດັບພື້ນຖານທີ່ດີສຳລັບ production server. ມັນໃຫ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການເພີ່ມແຜ່ນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (data disks) ແລະ IOPS throughput ສຳລັບດິສກ໌ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:20
msgid "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/dasv5-dadsv5-series"
msgstr "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/dasv5-dadsv5-series"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you only need a test instance, you can go smaller and choose an instance "
"size with 4 vCPUs and 16GB memory or use a _B-Series (Burstable)_ instance "
"with a similar configuration."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ສຳລັບການທົດສອບ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຂະໜາດທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ໂດຍເລືອກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ມີ 4 vCPUs ແລະ 16GB memory ຫຼື ໃຊ້ _B-Series (Burstable)_ ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:22
msgid "Diagnostic Storage Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການວິເຄາະ (Diagnostic Storage Account)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you normally create a VM in the Azure portal, boot diagnostics are "
"enabled by default using a managed storage account. You can choose an "
"existing storage account or create a new one (default)."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງ VM ໃນ Azure portal ຕາມປົກກະຕິ, boot diagnostics ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ managed storage account. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກບັນຊີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:24
msgid "OS Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ OS (OS Disk Size)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:25
msgid "This is the root disk of the {productname} installation, which holds:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ຫຼັກ (root disk) ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:26
msgid "The OS and the {productname} application."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS) ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:27
msgid ""
"[path]``/var/cache`` – where you need to provide storage space for each "
"product you want to manage."
msgstr "[path]``/var/cache`` – ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຽມພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:28
msgid "The proposed default of 100GB should be accepted."
msgstr "ຄວນຍອມຮັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແນະນຳຄື 100GB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:29
msgid "Database Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (Database Disk Size)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This holds the Database for {productname} and needs a minimum of 50GB. The "
"proposed value of 80GB is a good default suggestion."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ {productname} ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 50GB. ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳຄື 80GB ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:31
msgid "Spacewalk Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ Spacewalk (Spacewalk Disk Size)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:32
msgid ""
"This holds the package repositories and should have at least "
"100GB. Additional requirements include:"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເກັບຄັງຊອບແວ (package repositories) ແລະ ຄວນມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 100GB. ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມເຕີມລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:33
msgid "50GB for every SUSE product."
msgstr "50GB ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:34
msgid ">360GB for every RedHat or other Linux product."
msgstr ">360GB ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນ RedHat ຫຼື Linux ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:35
msgid "The proposed default of 500GB is a safe default to start with."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແນະນຳຄື 500GB ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ປອດໄພສຳລັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Repository synchronization will fail if this directory runs out of disk "
"space."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງຊອບແວ (Repository synchronization) ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຖ້າພື້ນທີ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:37
msgid "Public IP Address for the VM"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP ສຳລັບ VM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:38
msgid ""
"By default, a Public IP Address is created to access the {productname} VM "
"and Application."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ VM ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "*If you use it, please ensure this is secure and access is limited.*\n"
msgstr "*ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ມັນ, ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າມັນປອດໄພ ແລະ ມີການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ.*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Running {productname} on the public cloud means implementing robust security "
"measures. It is essential to limit, filter, monitor, and audit access to the "
"instance. SUSE strongly advises against a globally accessible {productname} "
"instance that lacks adequate perimeter security."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະໝາຍເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້ມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຈຳກັດ, ກັ່ນຕອງ, ຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ກວດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. SUSE ແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດວ່າບໍ່ຄວນປ່ອຍໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທົ່ວໂລກໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະບົບຄວາມປອດໄພຮອບນອກທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:41
msgid ""
"You should carefully consider this, as the {productname} Server will have "
"access to all managed nodes. If someone gains access to {productname}, it "
"would mean access to all managed nodes as well. Threat actors actively scan "
"for accessible machines with open management ports (e.g., SSH or RDP), "
"especially on cloud providers."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາເລື່ອງນີ້ໃຫ້ດີ ເພາະເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆໂນດທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການຈັດການ. ຖ້າໃຜຜູ້ໜຶ່ງເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} ໄດ້, ມັນໝາຍເຖິງການເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໂນດທີ່ຈັດການຢູ່ນຳ. ຜູ້ບໍ່ຫວັງດີມັກຈະສະແກນຫາເຄື່ອງທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທີ່ມີການເປີດພອດການຈັດການ (ເຊັ່ນ: SSH ຫຼື RDP), ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:42
msgid ""
"A Network Security Group (NSG) is created by default if you choose to create "
"a Public IP. It only allows inbound SSH access via port 22 as a minimal "
"protection for the public IP."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພເຄືອຂ່າຍ (NSG) ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກສ້າງ Public IP. ມັນຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH ຂາເຂົ້າຜ່ານພອດ 22 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນການປ້ອງກັນຂັ້ນຕໍ່າສຸດສຳລັບ Public IP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:43
msgid ""
"It is recommended to additionally restrict access to a defined list of "
"networks and allow Azure's virtual network to drop requests originating from "
"other networks."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງເພີ່ມເຕີມສະເພາະລາຍຊື່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ ແລະ ໃຫ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນຂອງ Azure ປະຕິເສດ (drop) ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ມາຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Furthermore, you can add Just-in-Time access and/or use the Azure Bastion "
"Service, Firewall, VPN, or private network methods to secure public access."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບ Just-in-Time ແລະ/ຫຼື ໃຊ້ບໍລິການ Azure Bastion, Firewall, VPN, ຫຼື ວິທີການເຄືອຂ່າຍສ່ວນຕົວ (private network) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈາກສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:45
msgid ""
"You can choose not to create a Public IP address (which is more secure), but "
"you will need to use other methods to access the created {productname} VM "
"and its Web UI for further configuration. Additionally, you must take care "
"of the DNS and ensure a correct FQDN."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP (ເຊິ່ງປອດໄພກວ່າ), ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີອື່ນໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ VM ຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ Web UI ຂອງມັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການເລື່ອງ DNS ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ FQDN ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "DNS Prefix for the Public IP Address   \n"
msgstr "DNS Prefix ສຳລັບທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP   \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The {productname} server must resolve its FQDN correctly. If the FQDN cannot "
"be resolved, it can cause issues in several {productname} components."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຕ້ອງສາມາດແປ (resolve) FQDN ຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດແປ FQDN ໄດ້, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນຫຼາຍສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:48
msgid ""
"To ensure that the {productname} domain name can be resolved by its clients, "
"both server and client machines must be connected to a working DNS "
"server. You also need to ensure that *reverse lookups* are correctly "
"configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດຖືກແປໄດ້ໂດຍເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ທັງເຄື່ອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ DNS ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າ *reverse lookups* ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If you use the Public IP address, a DNS name is automatically created from "
"Azure. You only need to ensure that a unique name is used. The default "
"suggestion creates one by including a random number to make the domain name "
"unique."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP, ຊື່ DNS ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ Azure. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັບໃຜ. ຄຳແນະນຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສ້າງຊື່ໂດຍການລວມເອົາຕົວເລກແບບສຸ່ມເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຊື່ໂດເມນນັ້ນບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:50
msgid ""
"If you do not use the Public IP, you need to make sure that your setup can "
"resolve the FQDN correctly as mentioned above."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ Public IP, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານສາມາດແປ FQDN ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:51
msgid "Virtual Network / Subnet"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ / ຊັບເນັດ (Virtual Network / Subnet)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:52
msgid ""
"You will see a default proposal for a virtual network where {productname} "
"will reside. By clicking _edit_, you can adjust it to your needs."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນທີ່ {productname} ຈະຢູ່. ໂດຍການຄລິກ _edit_, ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນມັນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Remember that a _Managed Application_ will be deployed from SUSE to your "
"Azure tenant. Therefore, this network is the network in the _Managed "
"Resource Group (MRG)_ and cannot overlap with existing networks."
msgstr "ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ _Managed Application_ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກ SUSE ໄປຫາ Azure tenant ຂອງທ່ານ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນ _Managed Resource Group (MRG)_ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດທັບຊ້ອນກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:54
msgid ""
"At a later stage, you need to peer this network to the network with the "
"nodes you want to manage. Alternatively, you can create the managed nodes "
"within this network."
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດ peering ເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີໂນດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການ. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໂນດທີ່ຈະຈັດການໄວ້ພາຍໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ເລີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:55
msgid ""
"With all fields filled out, press _Next_ or _Create_. The Azure portal will "
"perform a final check and provide a summary screen of this deployment."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄົບທຸກຊ່ອງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດ _Next_ ຫຼື _Create_. Azure portal ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ ແລະ ສະແດງໜ້າສະຫຼຸບຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If everything is correct, press _Create_ to deploy the _Managed Application_ "
"for {productname}."
msgstr "ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ກົດ _Create_ ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ _Managed Application_ ສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "After Deployment"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ (After Deployment)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:58
msgid "After the VM is deployed, you can access it via SSH."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ VM ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນໄດ້ຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that since this is a {payg} image, you will be billed according "
"to your actual usage, including the number of systems you **manage** and "
"**monitor** with this instance. It's essential to regularly track and review "
"your usage to prevent unexpected costs and ensure alignment with your needs."
msgstr "ຂໍໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບພາບລະບົບແບບ {payg}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຮຽກເກັບເງິນຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຈິງຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານ **ຈັດການ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມກວດກາ** ດ້ວຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Client connections and Client Registration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ {payg} ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Connections and Registering {payg} and {byos} Images"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນຮູບພາບລະບົບ {payg} ແລະ {byos}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Registering {payg} instances with the {scclongform} or your own RMT server "
"will create conflicts that are not easily solved**.  \n"
"{payg} instances are automatically registered against the correct update "
"server when added to your cloud service provider {productname} instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ການລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ເຊີເວີ RMT ຂອງທ່ານເອງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຍາກ**. \n"
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີອັບເດດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting Up Additional {payg} {suse} Products in {azure}"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນຳໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ແບບ {payg} ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {azure}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establishing a {payg} {sle} Connection With {productname} {payg}"
msgstr "ການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {sle} ແບບ {payg} ກັບ {productname} {payg}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Once you have started up your {productname} {payg} instance and refreshed "
"products you can add **{payglongform} connections** via the menu:Admin[Setup "
"Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go] button.  This action links "
"your {productname} {payg} instance with additional {payg} products on "
"{azure}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລະ ອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payglongform}** ຜ່ານປຸ່ມ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຂອງທ່ານກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ອື່ນໆໃນ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payglongform}] and click the "
"btn:[+Add {payglongform}] button."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payglongform}] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[+Add {payglongform}]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Now that you have established connections to the {productname} {payg} "
"instance you can register them as clients.  To learn how to register various "
"clients see: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[Client "
"Registration Methods]"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ]"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion Timeouts"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາຂອງ Minion (Minion Timeouts)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Inbound and outbound connections to {azure} are released after 4 minutes of "
"being idle.  This affects minion connectivity, especially when your "
"{productname} server is in {azure} and you have some on-premises minions.  "
"If a connection is idle for more than 4 minutes, connectivity is lost."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກໄປຫາ {azure} ຈະຖືກປ່ອຍ (released) ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (idle) ເປັນເວລາ 4 ນາທີ. ນີ້ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ minion, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນ {azure} ແລະ ທ່ານມີ minion ບາງສ່ວນຢູ່ on-premises. ຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເກີນ 4 ນາທີ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຫຼຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:32
msgid "To resolve this issue on your minions:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໃນ minion ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Create a new configuration file at "
"i.a. [path]`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/keepalive.conf` and enable "
"[literal]`keepalive`:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ທີ່ [path]`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/keepalive.conf` ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ [literal]`keepalive`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 5\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"
msgstr ""
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 5\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:36
msgid "Restart the [literal]`venv-salt-minion service`."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [literal]`venv-salt-minion service` ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining the {productname} Server {payg} Public Cloud Image on {azure}"
msgstr "ການຂໍຮັບຮູບພາບລະບົບ Public Cloud ຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {azure}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Follow these step-by-step instructions to locate the {productname} "
"{productnumber} {payg} image on {azure}."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຮູບພາບລະບົບ {productname} {productnumber} {payg} ໃນ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:3
msgid "Firstly, log in to your Azure account, via https://portal.azure.com"
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບບັນຊີ Azure ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ https://portal.azure.com"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This makes sure that the Azure system is able to identify in which country "
"your account get billed."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລະບົບ Azure ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ວ່າບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານຖືກຮຽກເກັບເງິນຢູ່ໃນປະເທດໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:5
msgid ""
"It is important, as billing for {productname} {payg} is handled via the "
"Azure Marketplace.  As there are restrictions on which countries this "
"listing can be billed, the account you will transact to should be the one "
"you are logged into."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນ ເພາະການຮຽກເກັບເງິນສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ Azure Marketplace. ເນື່ອງຈາກມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດວ່າປະເທດໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດຮຽກເກັບເງິນຈາກລາຍການນີ້ໄດ້, ບັນຊີທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ຊື້-ຂາຍ ຄວນເປັນບັນຊີດຽວກັບທີ່ທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:6
msgid "There are currently two offers for {productname} {payg} on {azure}:"
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນມີສອງຂໍ້ສະເໜີສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {azure}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "** {productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support (EMEA Orders only)**\n"
msgstr "** {productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support (ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ໃນ EMEA ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support**\n"
msgstr "**{productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Pick the listing that reflects in which country your Azure account gets "
"billed. It depends on the _sold to address_ of the account, see "
"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cost-management-billing/manage/change-azure-account-profile."
msgstr "ເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັບປະເທດທີ່ບັນຊີ Azure ຂອງທ່ານຖືກຮຽກເກັບເງິນ. ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບທີ່ຢູ່ _sold to address_ ຂອງບັນຊີ, ເບິ່ງ https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cost-management-billing/manage/change-azure-account-profile."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Do *not* go directly to the Azure Marketplace and get the offer. Even if the "
"offers are visible, they should not be selected from here, as the Azure Web "
"page is not able to identify your billing account. *Always log into the "
"portal first*"
msgstr "ຫ້າມ *ບໍ່* ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ Azure Marketplace ໂດຍກົງເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະແດງຢູ່, ແຕ່ກໍບໍ່ຄວນເລືອກຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ ເພາະໜ້າເວັບ Azure ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸບັນຊີການຮຽກເກັບເງິນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. *ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Portal ກ່ອນສະເໝີ*"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid "After you are logged into the Azure Portal, click btn:[Create a resource]."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Azure Portal ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Create a resource]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Enter {productname} {productnumber} into the search field on the top and "
"press kbd:[RETURN]"
msgstr "ປ້ອນ {productname} {productnumber} ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ກົດ kbd:[RETURN]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
msgid ""
"You get a list of offerings and need to select the version of _{productname} "
"{productnumber} with 24x7 Support_ depending on your billing country."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ສະເໜີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງເລືອກເວີຊັນຂອງ _{productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support_ ໃຫ້ກົງກັບປະເທດທີ່ຮຽກເກັບເງິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For example, for an account billed in Germany, it would be _{productname} "
"{productnumber} with 24x7 Support (EMEA Orders Only)_."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສຳລັບບັນຊີທີ່ຮຽກເກັບເງິນໃນເຢຍລະມັນ, ຕ້ອງເລືອກ _{productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support (EMEA Orders Only)_."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:15
msgid "The offer show up as _Azure Application_ and not as a _Virtual Machine_"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຈະສະແດງເປັນ _Azure Application_ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ _Virtual Machine_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Click the description text to get the Product description and then on "
"btn:[Plans + Pricing]. If this is shown with a description and plan, you "
"have chosen the right offer. If there is nothing shown you selected the "
"wrong one."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳອະທິບາຍເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Plans + Pricing]. ຖ້າມັນສະແດງຄຳອະທິບາຍ ແລະ ແພັກເກດ (plan), ສະແດງວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຫຍັງສະແດງເລີຍ, ສະແດງວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຜິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:17
msgid "Next, click on the btn:[Create_ button]"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This will bring you to a form similar you may know from creating other Azure "
"resources.  There are two tabs you need to fill _Basic_ and _Virtual Machine "
"Settings_"
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຫາແບບຟອມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນ Azure ອື່ນໆ. ມີສອງແຖບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄື _Basic_ ແລະ _Virtual Machine Settings_"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Azure System Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລະບົບ Azure"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} offering in Azure need to communicate with the "
"Azure Billing API, therefore it is not a simple virtual machine (VM) "
"offering."
msgstr "{productname} {payg} ໃນ Azure ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບ Azure Billing API, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການໃຫ້ບໍລິການເຄື່ອງສະເມືອນ (VM) ແບບທຳມະດາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Azure has created the Managed Application offering for this use case.  For "
"more information, see "
"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-resource-manager/managed-applications/overview."
msgstr "Azure ໄດ້ສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີ Managed Application ສຳລັບກໍລະນີນຳໃຊ້ນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-resource-manager/managed-applications/overview."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture Diagram of a managed application"
msgstr "ແຜນວາດສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງ Managed Application"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "architecture of a managed application"
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງ Managed Application"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "AzureManagedApp.svg"
msgstr "AzureManagedApp.svg"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application resource group"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (Application resource group)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This resource group ( in the diagram _ResGroup A_ ) holds the managed "
"application instance, which could be translated as the metadata or "
"definition of the offering. It can only contain a single resource."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ (ໃນແຜນວາດແມ່ນ _ResGroup A_) ຈະເກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ Managed Application ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແປໄດ້ວ່າເປັນ Metadata ຫຼື ຄຳນິຍາມຂອງຂໍ້ສະເໜີ. ມັນສາມາດບັນຈຸຊັບພະຍາກອນໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A customer has full access to the resource group and uses it to manage the "
"life cycle of the managed application."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຢ່າງເຕັມສ່ວນ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງ Managed Application."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed resource group (MRG)"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (MRG)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This resource group ( in the diagram _MRG_ ) holds all the resources that "
"are required by the managed application. For example, an application's "
"virtual machines, storage accounts, and virtual networks."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ (ໃນແຜນວາດແມ່ນ _MRG_) ຈະເກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ Managed Application ຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຄື່ອງສະເມືອນ (VM) ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ບັນຊີບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເມືອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"A _managed application_ is similar to a solution template in Azure "
"Marketplace, with a few key differences:"
msgstr "_Managed Application_ ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບ Solution Template ໃນ Azure Marketplace, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The resources are deployed into a _managed resource group_ that is normally "
"managed by the application's publisher."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ (Deploy) ເຂົ້າໃນ _ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (Managed resource group)_ ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ (Publisher) ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"It is present in the customer's subscription, but an identity in the "
"publisher's tenant can be given access to the managed resource group."
msgstr "ມັນຢູ່ໃນການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription) ຂອງລູກຄ້າ, ແຕ່ຕົວຕົນ (Identity) ໃນ Tenant ຂອງຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The publisher's _management access_ and the customers _deny assignment_ are "
"optional."
msgstr "_ສິດການຈັດການ_ ຂອງຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ ແລະ _ການປະຕິເສດການມອບໝາຍ_ ຂອງລູກຄ້າແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"There are different permission scenarios available. SUSE is using here the "
"_Customer managed_ to give our customers of SUSE Manager full control."
msgstr "ມີຮູບແບບການກຳນົດສິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້. ໃນນີ້ SUSE ແມ່ນໃຊ້ແບບ _Customer managed_ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຂອງ SUSE Manager ມີສິດຄວບຄຸມຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customer managed"
msgstr "ຈັດການໂດຍລູກຄ້າ (Customer managed)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "Customer"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າ (Customer)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:19
msgid "Customer has full access to the solution (in the managed resource group)"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Solution ຢ່າງເຕັມສ່ວນ (ໃນກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:20
msgid "The customer manages the solution"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການ Solution"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ (Publisher)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:22
msgid "The publisher has no access to manage the solution."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງເພື່ອຈັດການ Solution."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The publisher develops the application and publishes on Azure Marketplace "
"but does not manage the application."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ເປັນຜູ້ພັດທະນາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Azure Marketplace ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The publisher licenses the application for billing through Azure "
"Marketplace."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ອອກໃບອະນຸຍາດ (License) ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສຳລັບການເກັບເງິນຜ່ານ Azure Marketplace."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instance requirements)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When setting up a {productname} {payg} instance on {azure}, it's essential "
"to consider system requirements for optimal performance and "
"functionality. The default requirements outlined below have been tailored "
"for smooth deployment and operation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ເທິງ {azure}, ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລະບົບເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດມາເພື່ອການນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຮາບລື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"By default, certain disks are automatically generated when establishing a "
"{productname} {payg} instance on {azure}. To complete the setup of these "
"disks, use the **mgr-storage-server** tool."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ດິສ໌ (Disk) ບາງອັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ເທິງ {azure}. ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື **mgr-storage-server**."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "{azure} System Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລະບົບ {azure}"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Requirement | Details\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
