#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Checks"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ {payg}"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking the credentials"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If the script fails to collect the credentials, it should provide a proper "
"error message in the logs and in the {webui}."
msgstr "ຫາກສະຄຣິບຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ, ມັນຄວນຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນ logs ແລະ ໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If the credentials are not working, [literal]``reposync`` should show the "
"proper error."
msgstr "ຫາກຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້, [literal]``reposync`` ຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using [literal]``registercloudguest``"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ [literal]``registercloudguest``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Refreshing or changing the [literal]``registercloudguest`` connection to the "
"public cloud update infrastructure should not interfere with the credentials "
"usage."
msgstr "ການ Refresh ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [literal]``registercloudguest`` ໄປຫາໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຂອງ public cloud ບໍ່ຄວນຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-payg-checks.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Running [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` will cause problems if no "
"new cloud connection is registered with the cloud guest command."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]```registercloudguest --clean`` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ cloud ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ cloud guest."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with Separate Disk for {byos}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ດ້ວຍດິສ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "ບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} setup results with an error while restarting services during "
"setup.  The setup fails on restarting [literal]``tomcat``."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການໃໝ່. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງ Restart [literal]``tomcat``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-error-1.png"
msgstr "tshoot-error-1.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "ສາເຫດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When {productname} is set up using separate disks for cache, {postgresql} "
"and spacewalk, the existing data within these partitions are covered under "
"the new mount point."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ດິສ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ Cache, {postgresql} ແລະ Spacewalk, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ພາຍໃນ Partition ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກປົກຄຸມພາຍໃຕ້ຈຸດ Mount ໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-partitions.png"
msgstr "tshoot-partitions.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Because of this, data for certain services like tomcat go missing due to a "
"broken symbolic link."
msgstr "ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບບາງບໍລິການ ເຊັ່ນ tomcat ຈຶ່ງຫາຍໄປເນື່ອງຈາກ Symbolic link ເພ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"
msgstr "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:10
msgid ""
"As {productname} instance of cloud already has some services set up, when "
"the data is not available during set up it causes the service to not restart "
"as expected.  Therefore the setup fails."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວມີບາງບໍລິການທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດ Restart ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຶ່ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-incomplete-files.png"
msgstr "tshoot-incomplete-files.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:12
msgid "Actual data which should be present:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ຄວນຈະມີຢູ່:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-actual-files.png"
msgstr "tshoot-actual-files.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to Recreate"
msgstr "ວິທີການຈຳລອງບັນຫາຄືນ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recreating the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳລອງບັນຫາຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} Server provisioned in {aws} uses relevant AMI for {byos}"
msgstr "{productname} Server ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໃນ {aws} ໂດຍໃຊ້ AMI ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Separate storage for spacewalk, {postgresql} and cache.  The size of the "
"partition depends on the repository to be synchronized."
msgstr "ແຍກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ spacewalk, {postgresql} ແລະ Cache. ຂະໜາດຂອງ Partition ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (Repository) ທີ່ຈະຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:18
msgid "Set up {productname} using [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "ວິທີແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To resolve or avoid the issue, copy the data of the underlying partition "
"into the new partition by following the steps below:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ Partition ເດີມລົງໃນ Partition ໃໝ່ ໂດຍປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:22
msgid "Create a backup partition"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Partition ສຳຮອງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /bkp\n"
msgstr "mkdir /bkp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:24
msgid "Unmount the affected partition for example /var/cache."
msgstr "Unmount Partition ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ຕົວຢ່າງ /var/cache."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "umount /var/cache\n"
msgstr "umount /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Check the underlying data in the partition.  This should list the actual "
"data present in the directory."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານໃນ Partition. ອັນນີ້ຄວນຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ Directory."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:28
msgid "Copy the data onto the backup partition created in step 1."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນ Partition ສຳຮອງທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:30
msgid "Mount the partition again using option 1 or 2:"
msgstr "Mount Partition ອີກຄັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ 1 ຫຼື 2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(option 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(option 2)   mount -a (if you have the entries under /etc/fstab)\n"
msgstr ""
"(ທາງເລືອກ 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(ທາງເລືອກ 2)   mount -a (ຫາກທ່ານມີລາຍການຢູ່ໃນ /etc/fstab)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:32
msgid "Copy the backed up data from step 4 to the mounted partition"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 4 ລົງໃນ Partition ທີ່ Mount ແລ້ວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:34
msgid "Verify the data is present"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຂໍ້ມູນມີຢູ່ຈິງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:36
msgid "Repeat the {productname} setup"
msgstr "ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When using {productname} in public cloud with separate data partitions, make "
"sure that the existing data in those directories are copied onto the new "
"partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ Public Cloud ທີ່ມີການແຍກ Partition ຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນ Directory ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກກັອບປີ້ລົງໃນ Partition ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າໄຄລແອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses formulas with forms to configure your SAP clients.  There "
"are two formulas that you need to use:"
msgstr "{productname} ນຳໃຊ້ Formula ພ້ອມກັບ Form ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ SAP ໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານ. ມີສອງ Formula ທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:3
msgid "``Hana`` to configure the HANA database"
msgstr "``Hana`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:4
msgid "``Cluster`` to configure the clients into a cluster"
msgstr "``Cluster`` ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າໄຄລແອນເຂົ້າໃນຄລັດສະເຕີ (Cluster)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The formulas are provided by packages that you can download with your "
"package manager.  You need to install the formulas on the {productname} "
"Server.  When you have installed the package, you can use the {productname} "
"{webui} to enable and configure the formulas.  As you go through the formula "
"configuration process, provide details of the clients that contain your SAP "
"cluster, to set them up appropriately."
msgstr "Formula ຕ່າງໆແມ່ນມາຈາກແພັກເກດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ດ້ວຍ Package Manager ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Formula ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ Formula. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນການກຳນົດຄ່າ Formula, ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To install the formulas on the {productname} Server, use your package "
"manager to install these packages:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Formula ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Package Manager ຂອງທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:7
msgid "``saphanabootstrap-formula``"
msgstr "``saphanabootstrap-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:8
msgid "``sapnwbootstrap-formula``"
msgstr "``sapnwbootstrap-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:9
msgid "``drbd-formula``"
msgstr "``drbd-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:10
msgid "``habootstrap-formula``"
msgstr "``habootstrap-formula``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:11
msgid "``salt-shaptools``"
msgstr "``salt-shaptools``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The order that you enable and configure the formulas is important.  You must "
"enable, configure, and apply the HANA formula first.  Then you can enable, "
"configure, and apply the cluster formula.  If you perform these steps in the "
"wrong order, your SAP installation fails."
msgstr "ລຳດັບການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ Formula ແມ່ນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້, ກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ (Apply) Formula HANA ກ່ອນ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້, ກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ Formula Cluster ໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານເຮັດຜິດລຳດັບ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the HANA Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ HANA Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"click the client to use as the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ໄຄລແອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງຫຼັກ (Primary client) ໃນຄລັດສະເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, locate the ``Sap Hana "
"Deployment`` heading, and check the ``Saphanabootstrap`` formula in the "
"list.  Click btn:[Save] and apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ ``Sap Hana Deployment``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ Formula ``Saphanabootstrap`` ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Hana] tab, and "
"complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ Formula ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Formulas[Hana] ແລະ ກອກລາຍລະອຽດໃນຟອມໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Make sure you check [guimenu]``Install required packages`` to install "
"everything you need on the client.  In the [guimenu]``Nodes`` sections, type "
"the short hostname of the client to install the HANA database or the "
"hostname you can retrieve on the command line with:"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Install required packages`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນໄຄລແອນ. ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Nodes``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ Hostname ແບບສັ້ນຂອງໄຄລແອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA ຫຼື ຊື່ Hostname ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"
msgstr "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:19
msgid "Provide further details for the installation."
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate.  When the highstate is complete, you "
"can go on to apply the cluster formula."
msgstr "ກອກລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate. ເມື່ອ highstate ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ Formula Cluster ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_hana_formula.png"
msgstr "suma_sap_hana_formula.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the Cluster Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ Formula Cluster"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, locate the ``Cluster`` heading, "
"and check the ``Habootstrap`` formula in the list.  Click btn:[Save] and "
"apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ຊອກຫາຫົວຂໍ້ ``Cluster``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ Formula ``Habootstrap`` ໃນລາຍການ. ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Formula."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_formulas.png"
msgstr "suma_sap_formulas.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Cluster] tab, "
"and complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ Formula ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Formulas[Cluster] ແລະ ກອກລາຍລະອຽດໃນຟອມໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Make sure you check [guimenu]``Install required packages`` to install "
"everything you need on the client.  Give your cluster a name, and specify "
"the hostname of the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Install required packages`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນໄຄລແອນ. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ຄລັດສະເຕີຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ລະບຸຊື່ Hostname ຂອງໄຄລແອນຫຼັກໃນຄລັດສະເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate."
msgstr "ກອກລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Save] ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_cluster_formula.png"
msgstr "suma_sap_cluster_formula.png"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick Start: SAP Overview"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ່ວນ: ພາບລວມຂອງ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to use {productname} to install and configure "
"an SAP cluster.  It guides you through setting up a single {productname} "
"Server, preparing your client systems, and configuring the cluster using "
"formulas."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີ. ມັນຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ດ່ຽວ, ການກຽມລະບົບໄຄລແອນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າຄລັດສະເຕີໂດຍໃຊ້ Formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about SAP, see the SAP documentation at "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ SAP, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ SAP ໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about {productname}, see the {productname} "
"documentation at https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {productname}, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ {productname} ໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/suma."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing Clients"
msgstr "ການກຽມໄຄລແອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your SAP cluster requires several client systems.  Prepare your clients on "
"physical or virtual hardware, and ensure you have {sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP "
"installation media ready.  You cannot create an SAP cluster without the "
"{sles} SAP extension, as it provides tooling specific to SAP."
msgstr "SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບົບໄຄລແອນຫຼາຍລະບົບ. ໃຫ້ກຽມໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໃນຮາດແວຈິງ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງສະເມືອນ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານມີສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP ພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (Extension) {sles} SAP ເພາະມັນໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືສະເພາະສຳລັບ SAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"One of the key features of SAP is high availability of the cluster.  Every "
"component within an SAP cluster has redundancy and failover protection.  "
"When you are preparing your clients, ensure you have enough hardware and "
"infrastructure to allow for this.  For more information about hardware "
"requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"
msgstr "ໜຶ່ງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງ SAP ແມ່ນຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສູງ (High availability) ຂອງຄລັດສະເຕີ. ທຸກອົງປະກອບພາຍໃນ SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີມີລະບົບສຳຮອງ ແລະ ການປ້ອງກັນການເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ. ເມື່ອທ່ານກຽມໄຄລແອນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຮາດແວ ແລະ ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານພຽງພໍສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຮາດແວ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the clients you need to set up for an SAP "
"cluster, see https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the {scclongform}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນໄຄລແອນກັບ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each client within your SAP cluster must be registered with the "
"{scclongform}.  To obtain your registration code, navigate to "
"https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser.  Log in to your {scc} "
"account, or follow the prompts to create a new account.  Click the "
"btn:[Subscriptions] tab to see the registration code.  When you install "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP the {unifiedinstaller} prompts you for the code."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງໃນ SAP ຄລັດສະເຕີຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}. ເພື່ອຮັບລະຫັດການລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່. ຄລິກແທັບ [Subscriptions] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລະຫັດການລົງທະບຽນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP, ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງ {unifiedinstaller} ຈະຖາມຫາລະຫັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about registering {productname} with {scclongform}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} ກັບ {scclongform}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the Clients for Clustering"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າໄຄລແອນສຳລັບຄລັດສະເຕີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Every client system must have all the other client systems listed in their "
"[path]``/etc/hosts`` file.  Open the [path]``/etc/hosts`` file on each "
"client, and add the hostname for each of the other clients."
msgstr "ທຸກລະບົບໄຄລແອນຕ້ອງມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງລະບົບໄຄລແອນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດໃນໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/hosts``. ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄລແອນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຊື່ Hostname ຂອງໄຄລແອນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດລົງໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Shared Storage Device"
msgstr "ສ້າງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Each of the clients needs to be able to access a shared disk.  The shared "
"disk can be physical hardware connected by ethernet, or you can set up a "
"virtual disk and access it with iSCSI."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງດິສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ (Shared disk) ໄດ້. ດິສ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນສາມາດເປັນຮາດແວຈິງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍອີເທີເນັດ ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສ໌ສະເມືອນ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງດ້ວຍ iSCSI."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you use a virtual disk, consider hosting it on a separate system.  Do not "
"use a client machine to host the shared storage disk."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ດິສ໌ສະເມືອນ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາການໂຮສໄວ້ໃນລະບົບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ຢ່າໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໄຄລແອນເພື່ອໂຮສດິສ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the SAP Installation Software"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດຊອບແວການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Download the SAP installation media and save a copy on each client.  The "
"software that you require differs depending on your environment.  For "
"example, if you are using HANA, you need the SAP HANA platform.  If you are "
"using Netweaver, you need different packages.  These software packages are "
"provided by SAP, not by {suse}."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ແລະ ບັນທຶກສຳເນົາໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄລແອນ. ຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ HANA, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແພລັດຟອມ SAP HANA. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ Netweaver, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງການແພັກເກດອື່ນ. ແພັກເກດຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ SAP, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure you have saved the installation software in the same file system "
"location on each client.  Alternatively, save it to a shared NFS drive."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ບັນທຶກຊອບແວການຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນໃນແຕ່ລະໄຄລແອນ. ຫຼື ອາດຈະບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ NFS ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients to Use Latest ``module.run``"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າໄຄລແອນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``module.run`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Each client needs to be configured to use the latest version of "
"``module.run``.  On each of the client machines, open the "
"``/etc/salt/minion`` configuration file and add or edit this line:"
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``module.run`` ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງໄຄລແອນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ ``/etc/salt/minion`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"
msgstr ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:19
msgid "Restart the ``salt-minion`` process to enable the changes:"
msgstr "Restart ຂະບວນການ ``salt-minion`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Additional Disks for HANA"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງດິສ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For the clients that are going to run the HANA database, you require an "
"additional storage device.  This device is used to store files required by "
"HANA, which are located in the [path]``/hana/`` directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ຈະລັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ HANA, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ອຸປະກອນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ HANA ຕ້ອງການ ເຊິ່ງຢູ່ໃນ Directory [path]``/hana/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:23
msgid ""
"We recommend that this storage device be at least 20{nbsp}GB.  For some "
"installations, you might require more, and it is possible to use multiple "
"disks to provide this storage.  For comprehensive hardware requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 20{nbsp}GB. ສຳລັບບາງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ຫຼາຍດິສ໌ເພື່ອສະໜອງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້. ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຮາດແວທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the Server"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນໄຄລແອນກັບເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:25
msgid ""
"First of all, make sure you have an activation key that is associated with "
"the ``SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15`` base channel.  For more information about "
"activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ Activation Key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (Base channel) ``SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Activation Keys, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping].  Fill "
"in the appropriate details, and make sure you check the [guimenu]``Manage "
"System Completely via SSH`` checkbox.  In the [guimenu]``Activation Key`` "
"field, select the SLES for SAP activation key."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Bootstrapping]. ກອກລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Manage System Completely via SSH``. ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Activation Key``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ SLES for SAP activation key."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about registering, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Server"
msgstr "ການກຽມເຊີເວີ"

#.  This section needs cleanup for containers!!!
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you start you need to deploy the {productname} Server.  The method "
"for deploying the {productname} Server varies depending on your hardware and "
"environment."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server. ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຮາດແວ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} is deployed using the `mgradm` command.  During the deployment "
"process, when you are prompted for which product to install, select "
"{productname} Server.  For more information about deploying the "
"{productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]."
msgstr "{productname} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm`. ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເມື່ອທ່ານຖືກຖາມວ່າຈະຕິດຕັ້ງຜະລິດຕະພັນໃດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {productname} Server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You need to do some configuration to set up the {productname} {webui}.  In "
"your browser, navigate to the URL of the server, and configure your "
"administration access to the {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຄ່າບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {webui}. ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງການບໍລິຫານຈັດການສຳລັບ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Now you can use the {webui} to prepare software channels and activation keys "
"for your clients."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ເພື່ອກຽມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ (Software channels) ແລະ Activation keys ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, add the appropriate SAP channels: From the "
"{webui}, add [systemitem]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP``."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ SAP ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ: ຈາກ {webui}, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {productname} Server with the {scclongform}.  You can do "
"this using the {webui}.  Add the new channel to your activation key."
msgstr "ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} Server ກັບ {scclongform}. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}. ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນ Activation key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To check if a channel has finished synchronizing navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab.  This "
"dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລະ ເລືອກແທັບ [guimenu]``Products``. ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກມັນກຳລັງຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Software channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization "
"can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the "
"channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original "
"synchronization data."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານ Clone ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບມັນ. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງຂອງການຊິງຄ໌ເດີມ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt commands have three main components: target, function, and arguments.  "
"The calls are constructed in this format:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ມີສາມອົງປະກອບຫຼັກ: Target, Function, ແລະ Arguments. ການຮຽກໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຮູບແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"
msgstr "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The target defines the client, or group of clients, on which to run the "
"function."
msgstr "Target ແມ່ນຕົວລະບຸໄຄລແອນ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມໄຄລແອນ ທີ່ຈະລັນ Function."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:5
msgid "The function is the particular task to be run."
msgstr "Function ແມ່ນວຽກສະເພາະທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງລັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:6
msgid "Arguments provide any extra data required by the function."
msgstr "Arguments ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆທີ່ Function ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Targets"
msgstr "Salt Targets (ເປົ້າໝາຍ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Salt command targets allow you to specify a client or group of clients.  "
"There are several different targets you can use."
msgstr "Salt command targets ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸໄຄລແອນ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມໄຄລແອນໄດ້. ມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບຂອງ Target ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Targeting"
msgstr "ການລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:10
msgid "List available grains on all clients:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ grains ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນທຸກໄຄລແອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' grains.ls\n"
msgstr "salt '*' grains.ls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:12
msgid "Target a specific client:"
msgstr "ລະບຸໄຄລແອນສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Glob Targeting"
msgstr "ການລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Glob"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:15
msgid "Target all clients using a particular domain:"
msgstr "ລະບຸທຸກໄຄລແອນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດເມນສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:17
msgid "Target all clients using a particular label:"
msgstr "ລະບຸທຸກໄຄລແອນທີ່ໃຊ້ເລເບລ (Label) ສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "List Targeting"
msgstr "ການລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍແບບລາຍຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:20
msgid "Specify a flat list of clients, using their IDs:"
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍຊື່ໄຄລແອນໂດຍໃຊ້ ID ຂອງພວກເຂົາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regular Expression Targeting"
msgstr "ການລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Regular Expression"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:23
msgid "You can also define targets with PCRE-compliant regular expressions:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດ Target ດ້ວຍ PCRE-compliant regular expressions ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "IP Address Targeting"
msgstr "ການລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍທີ່ຢູ່ IP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:26
msgid "List available client IP addresses:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງໄຄລແອນທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"
msgstr "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:28
msgid "Target a specific client IP address:"
msgstr "ລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງໄຄລແອນສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:30
msgid "Target all clients on a subnet:"
msgstr "ລະບຸທຸກໄຄລແອນໃນ Subnet:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"

#
#. This is general Linux info, not specific to the topic.
#. You can use the [command]``ip`` command to find the subnet mask in the format of ``192.168.1.1/24``:
#. ----
#. ip -o -f inet addr show | awk '/scope global/ {print $4}'
#. ----
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more on targeting, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລະບຸເປົ້າໝາຍ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Execution Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການປະຕິບັດການຂອງ Salt (Execution Modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:34
msgid ""
"When you have specified a target, provide the module and function to execute "
"on the target."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານລະບຸ Target ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ Module ແລະ Function ທີ່ຈະລັນໃນ Target ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:35
msgid "Find which modules can be executed on the target:"
msgstr "ຊອກຫາວ່າ Module ໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດລັນໄດ້ໃນ Target:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' sys.doc\n"
msgstr "salt '*' sys.doc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For a full list of callable modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ Module ທັງໝົດທີ່ສາມາດຮຽກໃຊ້ໄດ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Function Arguments"
msgstr "Arguments ຂອງ Salt Function"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:39
msgid "Functions accept arguments for any extra data."
msgstr "Function ສາມາດຮັບ Arguments ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For example, the [command]``pkg.install`` function requires an argument "
"specifying which package to install:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: Function [command]``pkg.install`` ຕ້ອງການ Argument ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"
msgstr "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:42
msgid ""
"You can provide more than one argument to a function, with spaces between "
"them.  For example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ Argument ໃຫ້ກັບ Function ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຍະຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: "
"\"John\"}'\n"
msgstr "salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: \"John\"}'\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການກຳນົດຄ່າ (Configuration Modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt uses execution and state modules to define, apply, and orchestrate "
"configuration of your devices.  {productname} provides a set of modules "
"called {uyuni} configuration modules, that you can use to configure both "
"{susemgr} and {uyuni} Servers."
msgstr "Salt ໃຊ້ Execution ແລະ State modules ເພື່ອກຳນົດ, ນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ຈັດການການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ. {productname} ໃຫ້ຊຸດຂອງ Module ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ {uyuni} configuration modules ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄຳນົດຄ່າທັງ {susemgr} ແລະ {uyuni} Servers."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can use the {uyuni} configuration modules directly or using SLS files.  "
"They are especially useful if you have multiple {productname} Servers, for "
"example in Hub installations, but they are also useful for smaller "
"installations."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {uyuni} configuration modules ໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ SLS. ພວກມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກທ່ານມີຫຼາຍ {productname} Servers ເຊັ່ນ ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ Hub, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍຍັງມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດນ້ອຍເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about using Hub, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Hub, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:5
msgid "You can use {uyuni} configuration modules to configure:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {uyuni} configuration modules ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:6
msgid "Organizations"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ (Organizations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:7
msgid "Users"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Users)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:8
msgid "User permissions"
msgstr "ສິດການໃຊ້ງານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:9
msgid "System groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບ (System groups)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:10
msgid "Activation Keys"
msgstr "Activation Keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt execution modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/modules.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt execution modules, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/modules.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt state modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt state modules, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/starting_states.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Configuration Modules"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂມດູນການກຳນົດຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The {uyuni} configuration modules are available in the "
"[package]``uyuni-config-modules`` package.  On the {productname} Server, at "
"the command prompt, as root, use this command:"
msgstr "{uyuni} configuration modules ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດ [package]``uyuni-config-modules``. ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ Command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in uyuni-config-modules\n"
msgstr "zypper in uyuni-config-modules\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This package also installs detailed API descriptions, indications on pillar "
"settings, and examples.  When you have installed the package, navigate to "
"[package]``/usr/share/doc/packages/uyuni-config-modules/``."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດນີ້ຍັງຕິດຕັ້ງລາຍລະອຽດ API, ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Pillar ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງຕ່າງໆ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [package]``/usr/share/doc/packages/uyuni-config-modules/``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on the size and spreadness of the environment where {productname} "
"is used some connectivity issues are possible.  There are no common "
"recommendations for all the possible use cases as the environments could be "
"very different expecially if public clouds instances are involved."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ການກະຈາຍຕົວຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ {productname} ຖືກນຳໃຊ້, ບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບາງຢ່າງອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ບໍ່ມີຄຳແນະນຳທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບທຸກກໍລະນີ ເພາະສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ Public cloud ເຂົ້າມາກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Minions"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In case clients are losing the connection to the {productname} Server (or "
"{productname} Proxy if involved), they are unreachable from the "
"{productname} Server {webui} or with command line tools.  To understand such "
"a connection issue check if the client is not reachable from the "
"{productname} Server with [command]``salt MINION_ID test.ping``, while "
"[command]``venv-salt-call test.ping`` (or [command]``salt-call test.ping`` "
"if non-bundle {salt} is used on the client) is working fine on the client "
"side.  If this is the case, it is recommended to set "
"[literal]``tcp_keepalive`` parameters."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຄລແອນສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server (ຫຼື {productname} Proxy ຫາກມີ), ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ {productname} Server {webui} ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມື Command line. ເພື່ອທົດສອບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າໄຄລແອນບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``salt MINION_ID test.ping`` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ [command]``venv-salt-call test.ping`` ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ປົກກະຕິຢູ່ໃນຝັ່ງໄຄລແອນ. ຫາກເປັນເຊັ່ນນີ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາມາມິເຕີ [literal]``tcp_keepalive``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The parameters with the values from the example below can be used as a "
"starting point to look for settings, which could prevent cases of connection "
"loss without restoring for some environments.  It is recommended to put the "
"parameters in the separate drop-in configuration file like "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`` or "
"[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf``, depending on the minion "
"type used on the client side."
msgstr "ພາມາມິເຕີພ້ອມກັບຄ່າຈາກຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ເຊິ່ງອາດຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນກໍລະນີການສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກູ້ຄືນໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃສ່ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ເຊັ່ນ [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`` ຫຼື [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf``, ຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງ Minion ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຝັ່ງໄຄລແອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Keepalive Parameters Example Values"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງຂອງພາມາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######      Keepalive settings        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ZeroMQ now includes support for configuring SO_KEEPALIVE if supported by\n"
"# the OS. If connections between the minion and the master pass through\n"
"# a state tracking device such as a firewall or VPN gateway, there is\n"
"# the risk that it could tear down the connection the master and minion\n"
"# without informing either party that their connection has been taken "
"away.\n"
"# Enabling TCP Keepalives prevents this from happening.\n"
msgstr ""
"######      Keepalive settings        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ZeroMQ ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າ SO_KEEPALIVE ຫາກ OS ຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"# ຫາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ minion ແລະ master ຜ່ານອຸປະກອນຕິດຕາມສະຖານະ\n"
"# ເຊັ່ນ Firewall ຫຼື VPN gateway, ມັນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອາດຖືກຕັດ\n"
"# ໂດຍທີ່ທັງສອງຝ່າຍບໍ່ຮູ້. ການເປີດໃຊ້ TCP Keepalives ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນີ້.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Overall state of TCP Keepalives, enable (1 or True), disable (0 or "
"False)\n"
"# or leave to the OS defaults (-1), on Linux, typically disabled. Default "
"True, enabled.\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# ສະຖານະໂດຍລວມຂອງ TCP Keepalives, ເປີດໃຊ້ (1 ຫຼື True), ປິດໃຊ້ (0 ຫຼື False)\n"
"# ຫຼື ປ່ອຍໄວ້ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OS (-1), ໃນ Linux ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ True (ເປີດໃຊ້).\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How long before the first keepalive should be sent in seconds. Default "
"300\n"
"# to send the first keepalive after 5 minutes, OS default (-1) is typically "
"7200 seconds\n"
"# on Linux see /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດ (ວິນາທີ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 300\n"
"# ເພື່ອສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກ 5 ນາທີ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OS (-1) ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 7200 ວິນາທີ\n"
"# ໃນ Linux ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How many lost probes are needed to consider the connection lost. Default "
"-1\n"
"# to use OS defaults, typically 9 on Linux, see "
"/proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ probe ຫາຍໄປກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 9 ໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How often, in seconds, to send keepalives after the first one. Default -1 "
"to\n"
"# use OS defaults, typically 75 seconds on Linux, see\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການສົ່ງ keepalive ຫຼັງຈາກອັນທຳອິດ (ວິນາທີ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 75 ວິນາທີໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງ\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxies Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Proxies"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:13
msgid ""
"[command]``salt-broker`` service is used on {productname} Proxies to forward "
"{salt} traffic between the {productname} Server and [command]``salt-minion`` "
"service used on the client side.  It is possible that "
"[command]``salt-broker`` and all the clients behind it could be affected "
"with the same issue as the clients directly connected to the {productname} "
"Server.  The issue could be fixed with the same parameters as recommended "
"for the minions, but specified in [path]``/etc/salt/broker`` on each "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ [command]``salt-broker`` ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxies ເພື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນ {salt} ລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Server ແລະ ບໍລິການ [command]``salt-minion`` ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຝັ່ງໄຄລແອນ. ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ [command]``salt-broker`` ແລະ ທຸກໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງມັນ ອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກບັນຫາດຽວກັນກັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server. ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາມາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບ Minions, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/salt/broker`` ໃນແຕ່ລະ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:14
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy connectivity can also suffer when the connectivity to "
"the {productname} Server is lost for a quite long interval.  In such a case "
"Proxy connected clients started to retry the authentication to the "
"[command]``salt-master`` service on the {productname} Server.  This "
"situation could be potentially dangerous because it could lead to collecting "
"large amount of ZeroMQ messages with authentication attemps in the interal "
"buffer of ZeroMQ sockets used inside the [command]``salt-broker`` service.  "
"Then, on restoring the connection to the [command]``salt-master`` all of the "
"pending messages will be pushed to it.  It could lead to the issues on "
"{productname} Server side with [command]``salt-master`` service, because it "
"could be impossible to serve all the cached requests in appropriate time or "
"even to the complete denial of the service."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ {productname} Proxy ອາດຈະມີບັນຫາໄດ້ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} Server ຂາດຫາຍໄປເປັນເວລາດົນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ໄຄລແອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ Proxy ຈະເລີ່ມພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃໝ່ (Retry authentication) ໄປຫາບໍລິການ [command]``salt-master`` ໃນ {productname} Server. ສະຖານະການນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ ເພາະມັນອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ZeroMQ ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານທີ່ມີຄວາມພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນ Buffer ພາຍໃນຂອງ ZeroMQ sockets ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິການ [command]``salt-broker``. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [command]``salt-master`` ກູ້ຄືນມາໄດ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປພ້ອມກັນ. ອັນນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນຝັ່ງ {productname} Server ກັບບໍລິການ [command]``salt-master`` ເພາະມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕອບສະໜອງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ທັງໝົດໃນເວລາທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ຫຼື ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To avoid such situation a set of tuning parameters is available.  As the "
"most important one, [option]``wait_for_backend`` should be set to "
"[literal]``True``.  This prevents opening the sockets for the clients behind "
"the proxy while the connectivity to the [command]``salt-master`` service is "
"not established.  In this case the messages from the clients are not "
"collected in the internal buffers.  ``drop_after_retries`` is setting the "
"number of retries before closing the sockets to drop the cached messages.  "
"The other parameters could help to fine tune the behavior for the "
"environment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສະຖານະການດັ່ງກ່າວ, ມີຊຸດຂອງພາມາມິເຕີປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. ທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ [option]``wait_for_backend`` ເຊິ່ງຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ [literal]``True``. ອັນນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນການເປີດ Sockets ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ Proxy ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບບໍລິການ [command]``salt-master`` ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈາກໄຄລແອນຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ Buffer ພາຍໃນ. ``drop_after_retries`` ແມ່ນການກຳນົດຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປິດ Sockets ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້. ພາມາມິເຕີອື່ນໆສາມາດຊ່ວຍປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Setting timeouts, intervals and ``drop_after_retries`` to lower values are "
"making [command]``salt-broker`` service more aggressive on detecting the "
"connection loss to the [command]``salt-master``, so that it puts the clients "
"behind the proxy to the conditions closer as they are connected directly to "
"the {productname} Server.  Increasing the values could provide some benefits "
"in case if the network channel between the {productname} Proxy and "
"{productname} Server is not stable enough, the message buffering can provide "
"some flexibility while re-establishing the connection."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Timeouts, Intervals ແລະ ``drop_after_retries`` ໃຫ້ມີຄ່າຕ່ຳລົງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການ [command]``salt-broker`` ກວດສອບການສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [command]``salt-master`` ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຄລແອນທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ Proxy ຢູ່ໃນສະພາວະທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server. ການເພີ່ມຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະໃຫ້ປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍລະຫວ່າງ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} Server ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍສະຖຽນ, ເຊິ່ງການເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໄວ້ໃນ Buffer ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Values for Keepalive Parameters"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າສຳລັບພາມາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   ZeroMQ connection options    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# For more details about the following parameters check ZeroMQ "
"documentation:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# All of these parameters will be set to the backend sockets\n"
"# (from the salt-broker to the salt-master)\n"
msgstr ""
"######   ZeroMQ connection options    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພາມາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ ZeroMQ:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# ພາມາມິເຕີທັງໝົດນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ Backend sockets\n"
"# (ຈາກ salt-broker ຫາ salt-master)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# connect_timeout (sets ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets how long to wait before timing-out a connect to the remote socket.\n"
"# 0 could take much time, so it could be better to set to more strict "
"value\n"
"# for particular environment depending on the network conditions.\n"
"# The value equal to 10000 is setting 10 seconds connect timeout.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"
msgstr ""
"# connect_timeout (ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds)\n"
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໝົດເວລາ (Timeout) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Remote socket.\n"
"# 0 ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນເກີນໄປ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຄັ່ງຄັດຂຶ້ນ\n"
"# ຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂເຄືອຂ່າຍ.\n"
"# ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ 10000 ໝາຍເຖິງການຕັ້ງ Connect timeout ໄວ້ 10 ວິນາທີ.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# reconnect_ivl (sets ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 100\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time before reconnection attempt on connection "
"drop.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"
msgstr ""
"# reconnect_ivl (ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 100\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds)\n"
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# This parameter is important for detection of loosing the connection.\n"
"# In case of value equal to 0 it is not sending heartbits.\n"
"# It's better to set to more relevant value for the particular "
"environment,\n"
"# depending on possible network issues.\n"
"# The value equal to 20000 (20 seconds) works good for most cases.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds)\n"
"# ພາມາມິເຕີນີ້ສຳຄັນໃນການກວດສອບການສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"# ຫາກຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ 0 ມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງ Heartbeats.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ,\n"
"# ຂຶ້ນກັບບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"# ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ 20000 (20 ວິນາທີ) ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time to consider that the connection is timed out\n"
"# after sending the heartbeat and not getting the response on it.\n"
"# The value equal to 60000 (1 minute) is considering the connection is "
"down\n"
"# after 1 minute of no response to the heartbeat.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ (milliseconds)\n"
"# ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ (Timed out)\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງ Heartbeat ແລ້ວແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບສະໜອງ.\n"
"# ຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ 60000 (1 ນາທີ) ຈະຖືວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼຸດ\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກ 1 ນາທີທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕອບສະໜອງ Heartbeat.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   Other connection options    ######\n"
"# The following parameters are not related to ZeroMQ,\n"
"# but the internal parameters of the salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# default: -1\n"
"# value unit: number of retries\n"
"# Drop the frontend sockets of the salt-broker in case if it reaches\n"
"# the number of retries to reconnect to the backend socket.\n"
"# -1 means not drop the frontend sockets\n"
"# It's better to choose more relevant value for the particular "
"environment.\n"
"# 10 can be a good choise for most of the cases.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"
msgstr ""
"######   Other connection options    ######\n"
"# ພາມາມິເຕີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ ZeroMQ,\n"
"# ແຕ່ເປັນພາມາມິເຕີພາຍໃນຂອງ salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: -1\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ພະຍາຍາມ (retries)\n"
"# ປິດ Frontend sockets ຂອງ salt-broker ຫາກມັນພະຍາຍາມ\n"
"# ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Backend socket ຄົບຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ກຳນົດແລ້ວ.\n"
"# -1 ໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ໃຫ້ປິດ Frontend sockets\n"
"# ຄວນເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ.\n"
"# 10 ເປັນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# default: False\n"
"# The main aim of this parameter is to prevent  collecting the messages\n"
"# with the open frontend socket and prevent pushing them on connecting\n"
"# the backend socket to prevent large number of messages to be pushed\n"
"# at once to salt-master.\n"
"# It's better to set it to True if there is significant numer of minions\n"
"# behind the salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: False\n"
"# ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກຂອງພາມາມິເຕີນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມ\n"
"# ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Frontend socket ເປີດຢູ່ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດພ້ອມກັນ\n"
"# ເມື່ອ Backend socket ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ\n"
"# salt-master ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ True ຫາກມີ Minions ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ\n"
"# ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Salt States"
msgstr "Custom Salt States"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can create your own custom Salt states with {productname} as centrally "
"managed configuration channels.  Custom states are stored as Salt state "
"files on the {productname} Server with a ``.sls`` extension."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ Salt states ຂອງທ່ານເອງດ້ວຍ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ຈັດການຈາກສ່ວນກາງ. Custom states ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນໄຟລ໌ Salt state ໃນ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍນາມສະກຸນ ``.sls``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a New Custom Salt Channel"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Custom Salt Channel ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to create and edit custom Salt state "
"files.  You must create a state channel first, with an initial state named "
"``init.sls``.  The ``init.sls`` file is used to reference all other state "
"files within the channel.  The custom states that you create using the "
"{webui} are stored on the {productname} Server in the "
"[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/`` directory."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ custom Salt state. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ State channel ກ່ອນ ໂດຍມີ State ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຊື່ວ່າ ``init.sls``. ໄຟລ໌ ``init.sls`` ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງຫາໄຟລ໌ State ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດພາຍໃນ Channel. Custom states ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ທີ່ Directory [path]``/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:5
msgid ""
"After the channel is created with an ``init.sls`` file, you can write "
"additional state files in the {webui}.  Alternatively, you can upload "
"existing state files to use within your state channel, or import them from "
"other channels or clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ Channel ຖືກສ້າງດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ ``init.sls`` ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໄຟລ໌ State ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {webui} ໄດ້. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ State ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ State channel ຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ Channel ຫຼື ໄຄລແອນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Salt Channel and Initial State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Custom Salt Channel ແລະ State ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:23
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:29
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:52
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create State Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Create State Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:9
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type a name for your state."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ State ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a label.  Use alphanumeric characters, "
"hyphens, and underscores.  Do not use spaces."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ພິມເລເບລ (Label). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນ, ຕົວເລກ, ຂີດຕໍ່ (-) ແລະ ຂີດກ້ອງ (_) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ການຍະຫວ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type a short description of the "
"configuration your state performs."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ State ນີ້ດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, type the contents of your "
"``init.sls`` state.  If you want to reference file templates in this "
"configuration channel, ensure your file starts by specifying the source of "
"the managed file, using this syntax:"
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SLS Contents``, ໃຫ້ພິມເນື້ອໃນຂອງ State ``init.sls`` ຂອງທ່ານ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການອ້າງອີງຫາ File templates ໃນ Configuration channel ນີ້, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການລະບຸແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ (Source) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ ໂດຍໃຊ້ Syntax ນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"
msgstr ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid " Example custom state files are given later in this section.\n"
msgstr " ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ custom state ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Update Channel] to save your state.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Update Channel] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ State ຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Additional Files to a Custom State Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມລົງໃນ Custom State Channel"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid " Click the name of the channel you want to add files to."
msgstr " ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ Channel ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:19
msgid ""
"To create a new file, click btn:[Create configuration file] and type the "
"contents of the file."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Create configuration file] ແລະ ພິມເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To upload an existing file, click btn:[Upload Configuration Files] and "
"select the file to upload."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Upload Configuration Files] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະອັບໂຫຼດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To copy an existing file, click btn:[Import a File from Another Channel or "
"System] and select the file to copy."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Import a File from Another Channel or System] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສຳເນົາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Custom Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:24
msgid "Click btn:[View/Edit <filename>.sls File]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [View/Edit <filename>.sls File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:25
msgid "Make your changes to the file."
msgstr "ເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Update Configuration File] to save your state."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Update Configuration File] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ State ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You can also manage revisions, compare the state to others in your "
"organization, and download the ``.sls`` file from this dialog."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຈັດການລຸ້ນ (Revisions), ປຽບທຽບ State ກັບອັນອື່ນໆໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ ``.sls`` ໄດ້ຈາກກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning a Client to a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການມອບໝາຍໄຄລແອນໃຫ້ກັບ Custom Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:30
msgid "Click the name of the state you want to assign a client to."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ State ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍໄຄລແອນໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:31
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:32
msgid "Check the clients you want to assign."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກໄຄລແອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Subscribe systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt state modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/states/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt state modules, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/states/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Custom State Files"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ Custom State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:36
msgid ""
"This section contains some example custom state files.  Use these as a basis "
"for writing your own custom states."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວຢ່າງບາງຢ່າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ custom state. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານໃນການຂຽນ custom states ຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Manage a File"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຈັດການໄຟລ໌"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"
msgstr ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Package Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຈັດການແພັກເກດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"
msgstr ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Remote Command"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote Command)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"
msgstr ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Service Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຈັດການບໍລິການ (Service Management)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"
msgstr ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom State to Trust a GPG Key"
msgstr "Custom State ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:46
msgid ""
"By default, operating systems trust only their own GPG keys when they are "
"installed, and do not trust keys provided by third party packages.  The "
"clients can be successfully bootstrapped without the GPG key being trusted.  "
"However, you cannot install new third party packages or update them until "
"the keys are trusted."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະເຊື່ອຖືພຽງແຕ່ GPG keys ຂອງຕົນເອງເມື່ອຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື Key ທີ່ມາຈາກແພັກເກດຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ. ໄຄລແອນສາມາດຖືກ Bootstrap ໄດ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ GPG key ຖືກເຊື່ອຖື. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃໝ່ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ ຫຼື ອັບເດດພວກມັນໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າ Key ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Salt clients are set to trust {suse} tools channels GPG keys when they are "
"bootstrapped.  For all other clients and channels, you need to manually "
"trust third party GPG keys."
msgstr "Salt ໄຄລແອນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື {suse} ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກ Bootstrap. ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If you are bootstrapping Salt clients from the {productname} {webui}, you "
"can use a custom Salt state to trust the GPG key."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງ Bootstrap Salt ໄຄລແອນຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ custom Salt state ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting a GPG Key With a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key ດ້ວຍ Custom Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Locate the key that you need to trust.  Ensure you have the correct key, and "
"that you also have the fingerprint used to verify the key.  This information "
"is available from the vendor or, in some cases, from a key server."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ Key ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ Key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຍັງມີ Fingerprint ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ Key ນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດຫາໄດ້ຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ ຫຼື ໃນບາງກໍລະນີອາດຫາໄດ້ຈາກ Key server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Copy the key to a file location where the client can access it.  We "
"recommend saving it in the [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` directory, where "
"all user public files must be saved."
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ Key ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄຄລແອນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ Directory [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ສາທາລະນະທັງໝົດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:54
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type a name for your state.  For example, "
"``GPG Key Trusts``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ State ຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``GPG Key Trusts``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:55
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a label.  For example, "
"``GPG_Key_Trusts``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ພິມເລເບລ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``GPG_Key_Trusts``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type a short description of the "
"configuration your state performs.  For example, ``Trusts GPG Keys for "
"CentOS``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ State ຂອງທ່ານດຳເນີນການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``Trusts GPG Keys for CentOS``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, create a state to retrieve the "
"appropriate key from the {productname} Server and trust it on the client.  "
"The exact contents of your state varies depending on your client operating "
"system.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SLS Contents``, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ State ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ Key ທີ່ເໝາະສົມຈາກ {productname} Server ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃນໄຄລແອນ. ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ State ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງໄຄລແອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"
msgstr ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
msgstr ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Alternatively, you can add GPG keys to a configuration channel, using a "
"managed file to deploy them directly on the client.\n"
"  In this case, you would use a local path to the key, rather than a URL.\n"
msgstr ""
"  ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ GPG keys ເຂົ້າໃນ Configuration channel ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນໂດຍກົງໃນໄຄລແອນ.\n"
"  ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Path ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງສຳລັບ Key ແທນການໃຊ້ URL.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels] and click the name of the state you "
"want to assign a client to.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ State ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍໄຄລແອນໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab and check the clients you "
"want to assign.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກໄຄລແອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Subscribe systems].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the configuration file is next run on the client, the GPG key is "
"trusted.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຖືກລັນໃນໄຄລແອນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, GPG key ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can manage your GPG keys from your own repository hosted "
"on an external file management system."
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການ GPG keys ຂອງທ່ານຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (Repository) ຂອງທ່ານເອງທີ່ໂຮສຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຈັດການໄຟລ໌ພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a custom state at highstate"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ Custom State ໃນ Highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:68
msgid ""
"To apply a custom state at highstate create a mapping in "
"[path]``/srv/salt/top.sls``.  This short example maps the [literal]``test`` "
"state to the system group [literal]``12``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອການນຳໃຊ້ custom state ໃນ highstate ໃຫ້ສ້າງການຈັບຄູ່ (Mapping) ໃນ [path]``/srv/salt/top.sls``. ຕົວຢ່າງສັ້ນໆນີ້ຈະຈັບຄູ່ State [literal]``test`` ເຂົ້າກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ [literal]``12``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"
msgstr ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt File Locations and Structure"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are several ways to set up the Salt file structure.  This section "
"describes how Salt is supported and set up as part of {productname} Server.  "
"The main configuration file is "
"[path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Do not edit the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` configuration "
"file.  This file belongs to the [package]``spacewalk-setup`` package and is "
"marked as [literal]``%config``.  When {suse} updates the "
"[package]``spacewalk-setup`` package, the [path]``susemanager.conf`` file is "
"overwritten, and any customization is lost.  Instead, add your own "
"configuration file to the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/`` directory.  This "
"prevents the update process from deleting your settings from the main "
"[path]``susemanager.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr "ຢ່າແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``. ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເປັນຂອງແພັກເກດ [package]``spacewalk-setup`` ແລະ ຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ເປັນ [literal]``%config``. ເມື່ອ {suse} ອັບເດດແພັກເກດ [package]``spacewalk-setup``, ໄຟລ໌ [path]``susemanager.conf`` ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງໃດໆຈະຫາຍໄປ. ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງທ່ານເອງລົງໃນ Directory [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/``. ອັນນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂະບວນການອັບເດດລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ [path]``susemanager.conf`` ຫຼັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Some settings from [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` that can "
"help with finding configuration options:"
msgstr "ບາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` ທີ່ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການຄົ້ນຫາຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different file roots. Custom salt states should only be placed "
"in\n"
"# /srv/salt.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"
msgstr ""
"# Configure different file roots. Custom salt states should only be placed in\n"
"# /srv/salt.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different pillar roots. Custom pillar data should only be "
"placed\n"
"# in /srv/pillar.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"
msgstr ""
"# Configure different pillar roots. Custom pillar data should only be placed\n"
"# in /srv/pillar.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When you are working with [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``, be "
"aware that:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຮັດວຽກກັບ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``, ໃຫ້ຄຳນຶງວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:8
msgid "Files listed are searched in the order they appear"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນປະກົດຂຶ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:9
msgid "The first matching file found is called"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:10
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt state data from five root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt state ຈາກ 5 Root directories:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt``"
msgstr "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This directory is shipped and updated with {productname} and includes "
"certificate setup and common state logic to be applied to packages and "
"channels."
msgstr "Directory ນີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບ ແລະ ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍ {productname} ເຊິ່ງລວມມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificate) ແລະ Common state logic ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:28
msgid "Do not edit or add custom Salt data to this directory."
msgstr "ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມ custom Salt data ເຂົ້າໃນ Directory ນີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states``"
msgstr "[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states``"
msgstr "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:16
msgid ""
"These directories are shipped and updated with {productname} or additional "
"extensions.  They include states for Salt formulas."
msgstr "Directory ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສົ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບ ແລະ ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍ {productname} ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ພວກມັນລວມມີ State ສຳລັບ Salt formulas."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt``"
msgstr "[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This directory is generated by {productname}, based on assigned channels and "
"packages for clients, groups, and organizations.  This directory will be "
"overwritten and regenerated.  It is the Salt equivalent of the {productname} "
"database."
msgstr "Directory ນີ້ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ {productname} ອີງຕາມຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລແອນ, ກຸ່ມ ແລະ ອົງກອນ. Directory ນີ້ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່. ມັນຄືຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:21
msgid "Within this directory, each organization has a sub-directory."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ Directory ນີ້, ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນຈະມີ Sub-directory ຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLS File Directory Structure"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂຄງສ້າງ Directory ຂອງໄຟລ໌ SLS"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... files needed by states (uploaded by users)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... other SLS files (created by users)...\n"
"For example:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # user created\n"
"│   │    ... other files needed by states ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # user created\n"
"            ... other SLS files ...\n"
msgstr ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... files needed by states (uploaded by users)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... other SLS files (created by users)...\n"
"For example:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # user created\n"
"│   │    ... other files needed by states ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # user created\n"
"            ... other SLS files ...\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/srv/salt``"
msgstr "[path]``/srv/salt``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This directory is used for custom state data, modules, and related data.  "
"{productname} does not operate or use this directory directly.  The state "
"data in this directory is used by the client highstate, and is merged with "
"the total state result generated by {productname}.  Use this directory for "
"custom Salt data."
msgstr "Directory ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບ custom state data, modules ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Directory ນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ State ໃນ Directory ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ client highstate ແລະ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ State ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Directory ນີ້ສຳລັບ custom Salt data."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:26
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt pillar data from two root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt pillar ຈາກ 2 Root directories:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:27
msgid ""
"/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: This directory is generated by "
"{productname}.  It is shipped and updated together with {productname}."
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: Directory ນີ້ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ມັນຖືກສົ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບ ແລະ ຖືກອັບເດດຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:29
msgid ""
"/srv/pillar:: By default, {productname} does not operate or use this "
"directory directly.  The custom pillar data in this directory is merged with "
"the pillar result created by {productname}.  Use this directory for custom "
"Salt pillar data."
msgstr "/srv/pillar:: ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Directory ນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ custom pillar ໃນ Directory ນີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ Pillar ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Directory ນີ້ສຳລັບ custom Salt pillar data."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can use the [systemitem]``gitfs`` fileserver backend to serve Salt data "
"from git repositories.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [systemitem]``gitfs`` fileserver backend ເພື່ອບໍລິການຂໍ້ມູນ Salt ຈາກ Git repositories. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bind Formula"
msgstr "Bind Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Bind formula is used to configure the Domain Name System (DNS) on the "
"branch server.  POS terminals will use the DNS on the branch server for name "
"resolution of {saltboot} specific hostnames."
msgstr "Bind formula ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ Domain Name System (DNS) ໃນ Branch server. ເຄື່ອງ POS ຈະໃຊ້ DNS ໃນ Branch server ເພື່ອແປງຊື່ (Name resolution) ຂອງ Hostnames ສະເພາະຂອງ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are configuring the Bind formula for a branch server with a "
"dedicated internal network, check that you are using the same fully "
"qualified domain name (FQDN) on both the external and internal branch "
"networks.  If the FQDN does not match on both networks, the branch server "
"will not be recognized as a proxy server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດຄ່າ Bind formula ສຳລັບ Branch server ທີ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ລະບຸຄົບຖ້ວນ (FQDN) ດຽວກັນທັງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ ແລະ ພາຍໃນຂອງ Branch. ຫາກ FQDN ບໍ່ກົງກັນທັງສອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ, Branch server ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນ Proxy server."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The following procedure outlines a standard configuration with two zones.  "
"Adjust it to suit your own environment."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບມາດຕະຖານທີ່ມີສອງໂຊນ (Zones). ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Zone 1 is a regular domain zone.  Its main purpose is to resolve{saltboot} "
"hostnames such as TFTP, FTP, or Salt.  It can also resolve the terminal "
"names if configured."
msgstr "Zone 1 ແມ່ນ Domain zone ທຳມະດາ. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງຊື່ {saltboot} hostnames ເຊັ່ນ TFTP, FTP ຫຼື Salt. ມັນຍັງສາມາດແປງຊື່ເຄື່ອງ POS ໄດ້ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Zone 2 is the reverse zone of Zone 1.  Its main purpose is to resolve IP "
"addresses back to hostnames.  Zone 2 is primarily needed for the correct "
"determination of the FQDNs of the branch."
msgstr "Zone 2 ແມ່ນ Reverse zone ຂອງ Zone 1. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງທີ່ຢູ່ IP ກັບຄືນເປັນ Hostnames. Zone 2 ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕົ້ນຕໍເພື່ອລະບຸ FQDNs ຂອງ Branch ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#.  REMARK: this procedure is probably too long.  Where to split?
#.  REMARK: are these list items (`*`) substeps?  Or what?  Confusing.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Bind with Two Zones"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Bind ດ້ວຍສອງໂຊນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Check the [systemitem]``Bind`` formula, click [btn]``Save``, and navigate to "
"the menu:Formulas[Bind] tab."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກ [systemitem]``Bind`` formula, ຄລິກ [Save] ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Formulas[Bind]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Config`` section, select [systemitem]``Include "
"Forwarders``."
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Config``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``Include Forwarders``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Configured Zones`` section, use these parameters for "
"Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Configured Zones``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter the domain name of your branch network "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branch1.example.com``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ກອກຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ Branch ຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branch1.example.com``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:12
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Type`` field, select [systemitem]``master``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``master``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Click [btn]``Add item`` to add a second zone, and set these parameters for "
"Zone 2:"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Add item] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໂຊນທີສອງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 2:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, use the reverse zone for the configured IP "
"range (for example: [systemitem]``com.example.branch1``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Reverse zone ສຳລັບຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``com.example.branch1``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:15
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Type`` field, select [systemitem]``master``"
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``master``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Available Zones`` section, use these parameters for "
"Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Available Zones``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter the domain name of your branch network "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ກອກຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ Branch ຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``File`` field, type the name of your configuration file."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``File``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Start of Authority (SOA)`` section, use these parameters "
"for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Start of Authority (SOA)``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Nameserver (NS)`` field, use the FQDN of the branch server "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Nameserver (NS)``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ FQDN ຂອງ Branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Contact`` field, use the email address for the domain "
"administrator."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Contact``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອີເມວສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໂດເມນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:22
msgid "Keep all other fields as their default values."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ປ່ອຍຫ້ອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດໄວ້ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Records`` section, in subsection [guimenu]``A``, use these "
"parameters to set up an A record for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Records``, ໃນພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``A``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ A record ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Hostname`` field, use the hostname of the branch server "
"(for example: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Hostname``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Hostname ຂອງ Branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``IP`` field, use the IP address of the branch server (for "
"example, [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``IP``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ Branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Records`` section, subsection [guimenu]``NS``, use these "
"parameters to set up an NS record for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Records``, ພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``NS``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ NS record ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the input box, use the hostname of the branch server (for example: "
"[systemitem]``branchserver``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງກອກຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Hostname ຂອງ Branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Records`` section, subsection [guimenu]``CNAME``, use "
"these parameters to set up CNAME records for Zone 1:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Records``, ພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``CNAME``, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ CNAME records ສຳລັບ Zone 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter [systemitem]``tftp``, and in the "
"[guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname of the branch server (for "
"example: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ກອກ [systemitem]``tftp``, ແລະ ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ພິມ Hostname ຂອງ Branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``ftp``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname "
"of the branch server."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [Add Item]. ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ກອກ [systemitem]``ftp``, ແລະ ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ພິມ Hostname ຂອງ Branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``dns``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname "
"of the branch server."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [Add Item]. ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ກອກ [systemitem]``dns``, ແລະ ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ພິມ Hostname ຂອງ Branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``dhcp``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the hostname "
"of the branch server."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [Add Item]. ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ກອກ [systemitem]``dhcp``, ແລະ ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ພິມ Hostname ຂອງ Branch server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Click [guimenu]``Add Item``. In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``salt``, and in the [guimenu]``Value`` field, type the FQDN of "
"the branch server (for example: "
"[systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [Add Item]. ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Key``, ໃຫ້ກອກ [systemitem]``salt``, ແລະ ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Value``, ໃຫ້ພິມ FQDN ຂອງ Branch server (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branchserver.branch1.example.org``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Set up Zone 2 using the same parameters as for Zone 1, but ensure you use "
"the reverse details:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Zone 2 ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາມາມິເຕີດຽວກັນກັບ Zone 1, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດແບບກັບຄືນ (Reverse):"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:35
msgid "The same SOA section as Zone 1."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພາກສ່ວນ SOA ດຽວກັນກັບ Zone 1."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:36
msgid "Empty A and CNAME records."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍ A ແລະ CNAME records ໃຫ້ວ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:37
msgid "Additionally, configure in Zone 2:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຄ່າໃນ Zone 2 ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:38
msgid ""
"`Generate Reverse` field by the network IP address set in branch server "
"network formula (for example, [systemitem]``192.168.1.5/24``)."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງ `Generate Reverse` ໃຫ້ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ Network IP ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ branch server network formula (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5/24``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:39
msgid ""
"`For Zones` should specify the domain name of your branch network (for "
"example, [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."
msgstr "`For Zones` ຄວນລະບຸຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ Branch ຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``branch1.example.org``)."

