#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:87
msgid "`ProxyCommand` if the client connects through a proxy"
msgstr "`ProxyCommand` ຖ້າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:89
