"`ssh_pre_flight`: The path to the pre flight shell script (default: "
"[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt-ssh/preflight.sh``)"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight`: ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ pre flight shell script (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: [path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt-ssh/preflight.sh``)"

