#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Using Yomi"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Yomi (yet one more installer) is an installer for {suse} and openSUSE "
"operating systems.  Yomi is designed as a Salt state, and can be used for "
"installing {suse} operating systems on new systems."
msgstr "Yomi (yet one more installer) ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ແລະ openSUSE. Yomi ຖືກອອກແບບມາເປັນ Salt state, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse} ລົງໃນລະບົບໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, Yomi can be used as part of provisioning new clients, as "
"an alternative to AutoYaST."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, Yomi ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນ AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:4
msgid "Yomi consists of two components:"
msgstr "Yomi ປະກອບມີສອງອົງປະກອບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The Yomi formula, which contains the Salt states and modules required to "
"perform the installation."
msgstr "ສູດ (formula) ຂອງ Yomi, ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸ Salt states ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The operating system image, which includes the pre-configured "
"``salt-minion`` service."
msgstr "ອິມເມຈ (image) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Both components can be used independently of {productname}, or integrated "
"with it.  This section describes how to use it with {productname}."
msgstr "ທັງສອງອົງປະກອບສາມາດໃຊ້ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ {productname} ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກໍໄດ້. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ ອະທິບາຍວິທີການໃຊ້ງານມັນຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information about using Yomi independently, see "
"https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Yomi ແບບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:9
msgid ""
"For build assets, see "
"https://build.opensuse.org/project/show/systemsmanagement:yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ build assets, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://build.opensuse.org/project/show/systemsmanagement:yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:10
msgid "To use Yomi for installing a client operating system, follow this process:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Yomi ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:11
msgid "Install the ``yomi-formula`` package."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ ``yomi-formula``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:12
msgid "Prepare the Salt pillar for the new installation."
msgstr "ກຽມ Salt pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:13
msgid "Boot the new client using the PXE boot image for Yomi."
msgstr "ບູດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ PXE boot image ສຳລັບ Yomi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:14
msgid ""
"To use Yomi with {productname}, ensure you have enough available memory.  To "
"boot from USB or DVD image, you need at least 512{nbsp}MB.  To boot from a "
"PXE server, you need at least 2{nbsp}GB."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ Yomi ກັບ {productname}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳພຽງພໍ. ໃນການບູດຈາກ USB ຫຼື DVD image, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 512{nbsp}MB. ໃນການບູດຈາກ PXE server, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 2{nbsp}GB."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງສູດ Yomi (Yomi Formula)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to install the Yomi formula, which is available "
"as a package in {productname}."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງສູດ Yomi ເຊິ່ງມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The ``yomi-formula`` package contains the Salt states and modules that "
"describe the Yomi state, and the formulas with forms to create the pillar.  "
"It also contains documentation about the different sections of the pillar, "
"and some examples about how to parameterize installations based on openSUSE, "
"MicroOS, or SLE."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ ``yomi-formula`` ບັນຈຸ Salt states ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ອະທິບາຍສະຖານະຂອງ Yomi, ແລະ ສູດຕ່າງໆ ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມເພື່ອສ້າງ pillar. ມັນຍັງມີເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ຂອງ pillar, ແລະ ບາງຕົວຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການກຳນົດພາລາມິເຕີສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍອີງໃສ່ openSUSE, MicroOS, ຫຼື SLE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:18
msgid "The formula package performs these actions:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດສູດນີ້ຈະດຳເນີນການດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Adds a new configuration file called ``yomi-formula.conf`` in the "
"[path]``/etc/salt/master.d/`` directory.  This configuration file defines "
"the Python module and Salt states required by Yomi."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າໃໝ່ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``yomi-formula.conf`` ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/``. ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ຈະລະບຸໂມດູນ Python ແລະ Salt states ທີ່ Yomi ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Installs the Yomi Salt states in the "
"[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/`` directory."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt states ຂອງ Yomi ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Provides some example configuration files in the [path]``/usr/share/yomi/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ສະໜອງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງບາງສ່ວນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Installs the required forms and sub-forms in the "
"[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/metadata/`` directory."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຟອມ ແລະ ແບບຟອມຍ່ອຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/metadata/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Provides some pillar examples in the [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "ສະໜອງຕົວຢ່າງ pillar ບາງສ່ວນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງສູດ Yomi"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information about the Yomi formula, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບສູດ Yomi, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the PXE Image"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To provision a new client, you need an operating system image to boot from.  "
"You can use any image that contains a ``salt-minion`` service enabled, "
"together with a minimal set of tools that are required during the "
"installation, for example ``parted`` or ``btrfstools``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອິມເມຈ (image) ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການບູດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອິມເມຈໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ໄວ້, ພ້ອມກັບຊຸດເຄື່ອງມືພື້ນຖານທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເຊັ່ນ: ``parted`` ຫຼື ``btrfstools``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Yomi provides an already prepared image, based on openSUSE Tumbleweed, "
"openSUSE Leap (for {uyuni}), or SLE (for {susemgr}).  For {productname}, the "
"image is packaged as an RPM.  This is done in a similar way to how "
"``pxe-default-image`` is distributed."
msgstr "Yomi ມີອິມເມຈທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ແລ້ວ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ openSUSE Tumbleweed, openSUSE Leap (ສຳລັບ {uyuni}), ຫຼື SLE (ສຳລັບ {susemgr}). ສຳລັບ {productname}, ອິມເມຈຈະຖືກບັນຈຸເປັນ RPM. ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບການແຈກຢາຍ ``pxe-default-image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The package installs a standard PXE OEM image generated by Kiwi, the initial "
"kernel and initrd in the [path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/`` directory, and the "
"second stage kernel, initrd and image in the "
"[path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image`` directory."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE OEM image ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ Kiwi, ໂດຍມີ kernel ແລະ initrd ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/``, ແລະ kernel, initrd ລວມທັງອິມເມຈໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີສອງຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີ [path]``/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the PXE Image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:35
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:37
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"``pxe-yomi-image`` service:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ (command prompt), ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ ບໍລິການ ``pxe-yomi-image``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-sle15\n"
msgstr "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-sle15\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15\n"
msgstr "zypper in pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:39
msgid "When you have the package installed, you can register Yomi in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ Yomi ໃນ {cobbler} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Yomi in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ Yomi ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:41
msgid ""
"{productname} uses {cobbler} to manage the PXE boot service, so you will "
"need to register the image in {cobbler}."
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອຈັດການບໍລິການບູດຜ່ານ PXE, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ ລົງທະບຽນອິມເມຈໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Image in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Image ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:43
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, create a "
"directory for the Yomi image:"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍລີສຳລັບ Yomi image:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr "mkdir /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Define a distribution in {cobbler}, including the path to install the second "
"stage kernel and initrd, the location of the full image, and any further "
"kernel options."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ distribution ໃນ {cobbler}, ລວມເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ kernel ແລະ initrd ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີສອງ, ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງອິມເມຈຕົວເຕັມ, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆ ຂອງ kernel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Adjust this command to include the correct version of the product, and the "
"TFTP server address:"
msgstr "ປັບປຸງຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລວມເອົາເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງ TFTP server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  "
"--boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' "
"\\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe "
"rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz "
"rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  --boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-sle15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' \\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  "
"--boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions "
"/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' "
"\\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe "
"rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz "
"rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler distro add \\\n"
"  --name=pxe-yomi-image \\\n"
"  --kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/linux \\\n"
"  --initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/initrd \\\n"
"  --boot-files='/srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.initrd=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.initrd /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.kernel=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.kernel /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.md5=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.md5 /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.config.bootoptions=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15-x86_64-1.0.0.config.bootoptions /srv/tftpboot/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz=/srv/pxe-yomi-image/image/pxe-yomi-image-opensuse15.x86_64-1.0.0.xz' \\\n"
"  --kernel-options='rd.kiwi.install.pxe rd.kiwi.install.image=tftp://<server-address>/pxe-yomi-image/image.xz rd.kiwi.ramdisk ramdisk_size=2097152 net.ifnames=1'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:49
msgid ""
"By default, the ``salt-minion`` service in ``pxe-yomi-image`` is configured "
"to find the Salt master under the ``salt`` address.  If the DNS server is "
"not able to resolve this address, you need to adjust the ``kernel-options`` "
"parameter from the {cobbler} command that register the distribution, and add "
"a new kernel command line of ``ym.master=master_address``.  This will "
"override the default configuration for the ``salt-minion``."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ໃນ ``pxe-yomi-image`` ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ ຄົ້ນຫາ Salt master ຜ່ານທີ່ຢູ່ ``salt``. ຖ້າ DNS server ບໍ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາທີ່ຢູ່ນີ້ໄດ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບພາລາມິເຕີ ``kernel-options`` ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ {cobbler} ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ distribution, ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄຳສັ່ງ kernel ໃໝ່ເປັນ ``ym.master=master_address``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໄປຂຽນທັບການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ ``salt-minion``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering the Yomi Profile in {cobbler}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນ Yomi Profile ໃນ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:51
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, define a "
"profile in {cobbler} based on the image."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ profile ໃນ {cobbler} ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ອິມເມຈນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler profile add \\\n"
"  --name pxe-yomi-profile \\\n"
"  --distro=pxe-yomi-image\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:53
msgid "OPTIONAL: Create a system in {cobbler}."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ສ້າງ system ໃນ {cobbler}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:54
msgid ""
"If you know the MAC address for the new client to be provisioned, you can "
"have it boot directly from the Yomi image."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC (MAC address) ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ມັນ ບູດຈາກ Yomi image ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"
msgstr ""
"cobbler system add \\\n"
"   --name=yomi \\\n"
"   --mac=00:11:22:33:44:55 \\\n"
"   --profile=pxe-yomi-profile\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the new node has been provisioned, remove the temporary {cobbler} "
"system:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບ system ຂອງ {cobbler} ຊົ່ວຄາວນັ້ນອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"
msgstr "cobbler system remove --name=yomi\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Salt Pillar Preparation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການກຽມ Salt Pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The parameters of the new installation are defined with a Salt pillar.  The "
"pillar includes parameters that the Yomi state requires during the "
"installation, including the partitions, file systems, repositories, packages "
"installed, and services enabled."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດດ້ວຍ Salt pillar. Pillar ນີ້ລວມເອົາພາລາມິເຕີ ທີ່ Yomi state ຕ້ອງການໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງພາທິຊັນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຄັງເກັບ (repositories), ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ບໍລິການທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:60
msgid ""
"The pillar is defined using the formulas with forms.  In this example, we "
"prepare the pillar for a minimal openSUSE Tumbleweed installation.  You can "
"find examples for MicroOS or SLES in the example directory "
"[path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."
msgstr "Pillar ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະກຽມ pillar ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Tumbleweed ແບບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ MicroOS ຫຼື SLES ໄດ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍລີຕົວຢ່າງ [path]``/usr/share/yomi/pillar/``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To begin, boot the client that you want to provision using the Yomi PXE boot "
"image, using the {cobbler} procedures described earlier in this section."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ບູດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ Yomi PXE boot image, ຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງ {cobbler} ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:62
msgid ""
"When the ``salt-minion`` service is running on the new client, accept the "
"key by navigating to menu:Salt[Keys].  When the key is accepted, you can "
"view and manage the client by navigating to menu:Systems[Overview].  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, and add all the Yomi Installer "
"formulas to the client.  When you have added all the formulas, complete the "
"forms and sub-forms.  This section outlines each form and provides example "
"settings for a minimal installation.  For a detailed explanation of every "
"option, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍລິການ ``salt-minion`` ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຍອມຮັບກະແຈໂດຍໄປທີ່ ເມນູ: Salt[Keys]. ເມື່ອກະແຈຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Overview]. ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Formulas``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມທຸກສູດ ຂອງ Yomi Installer ໃຫ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ເມື່ອເພີ່ມສູດທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນ ແບບຟອມ ແລະ ແບບຟອມຍ່ອຍ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສະຫຼຸບແຕ່ລະແບບຟອມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງການກຳນົດຄ່າ ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບພື້ນຖານ. ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂອງທຸກຕົວເລືອກ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:64
msgid ""
"The Yomi form contains some general configuration options.  For example, the "
"keyboard language and layout, the locale information, and the option to "
"perform a full reset of the system after provisioning."
msgstr "ແບບຟອມ Yomi ປະກອບມີຕົວເລືອກການກຳນົດຄ່າທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ພາສາ ແລະ ແຜັງແປ້ນພິມ, ຂໍ້ມູນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (locale), ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກໃນການຣີເຊັດລະບົບທັງໝົດຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:65
msgid "For this example, set the [parameter]``Reboot`` parameter to ``yes``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາລາມິເຕີ [parameter]``Reboot`` ເປັນ ``yes``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This sub-form provides information about the devices, partitioning, file "
"system (including the BtrFS subvolumes, for example), and LVM and RAID "
"configuration."
msgstr "ແບບຟອມຍ່ອຍນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອຸປະກອນ, ການແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ subvolumes ຂອງ BtrFS), ລວມເຖິງການກຳນົດຄ່າ LVM ແລະ RAID."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For this example, we assume that the new client has a single device named "
"``/dev/sda``, and that it belongs to a non-UEFI system.  In this case, we "
"have only three partitions: one for the boot loader, one for swap and one "
"for the system.  We also expect to have an ext4 file system for the root "
"directory."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ມີອຸປະກອນດຽວທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``/dev/sda``, ແລະ ມັນເປັນລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ UEFI. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະມີພຽງສາມພາທິຊັນ: ໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ boot loader, ໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ swap ແລະ ໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລະບົບ. ພວກເຮົາກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ext4 ສຳລັບ root directory."

