msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີ [parameter]``Kernel`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນ ``append`` ຂອງ GRUB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:101
msgid ""
"This form provides the different repositories and packages to install.  You "
"can also register the product in this form, using SUSEConnect, and install "
"the different modules after registering."
msgstr "ແບບຟອມນີ້ໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ແລະ ແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດ ລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນແບບຟອມນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ SUSEConnect, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໂມດູນຕ່າງໆ ຫຼັງຈາກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:102
msgid ""
"For this example we are going to install a very minimal openSUSE Tumbleweed "
"distribution, using publicly available repositories.  For production "
"deployments, you will need to provide a local repository."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Tumbleweed ແບບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ ຄັງເກັບທີ່ເປັນສາທາລະນະ. ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບພາຍໃນ (local repository)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:103
msgid "Add a new repository:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບໃໝ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:104
msgid "Repository Name: repo-oss"
msgstr "ຊື່ຄັງເກັບ: repo-oss"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:105
msgid "Repository URL: http://download.opensuse.org/tumbleweed/repo/oss/"
msgstr "URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບ: http://download.opensuse.org/tumbleweed/repo/oss/"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:106
msgid "Add these packages:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:107
msgid "pattern:enhanced_base"
msgstr "pattern:enhanced_base"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:108
msgid "glibc-locale"
msgstr "glibc-locale"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:109
msgid "kernel-default"
msgstr "kernel-default"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:110
msgid ""
"You can also add patterns and products, together with packages, by using the "
"correct prefix."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມ patterns ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳນຳໜ້າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:112
msgid ""
"By default Yomi is installed with the ``salt-minion`` service, but you must "
"enable it."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Yomi ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງພ້ອມກັບບໍລິການ ``salt-minion``, ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:113
msgid "Add a new enabled service:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມບໍລິການໃໝ່ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:114
msgid "Service 1:"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:115
msgid "Service: salt-minion"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ: salt-minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:117
msgid ""
"This form sets out the system users.  In this example, we have a single root "
"user.  To provide a password, you must use the hashed version of the "
"password, not the plain text.  This behavior is set to be changed in future "
"versions of Yomi."
msgstr "ແບບຟອມນີ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງລະບົບ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ພຽງຕົວດຽວ. ໃນການລະບຸລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນຮູບແບບ hash ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທົ່ວໄປ. ຮູບແບບນີ້ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນເວີຊັນຖັດໄປຂອງ Yomi."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:118
msgid "User 1:"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ 1:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:119
msgid "Username: root"
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້: root"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:120
msgid "Password Hash: $1$wYJUgpM5$RXMMeASDc035eXNbYWFl0"
msgstr "Password Hash: $1$wYJUgpM5$RXMMeASDc035eXNbYWFl0"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor the Installation"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:122
msgid ""
"You can monitor the installation as it progresses, using the ``monitor`` "
"tool from Yomi.  You can continue monitoring as the highstate is applied to "
"the new client.  To use the tool, you will need to have enabled ``Events`` "
"in the Yomi formula, and have the ``salt-api`` service activated."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື ``monitor`` ຂອງ Yomi. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມຕໍ່ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ``Events`` ໃນສູດ Yomi ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ ``salt-api``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:123
msgid ""
"For more information about the ``salt-api`` service, and how to use the "
"``monitor`` tool, see https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບໍລິການ ``salt-api`` ແລະ ວິທີການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື ``monitor``, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/openSUSE/yomi."

