msgstr "ຄຳນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/specialized-guides-overview.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/specialized-guides-overview.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This guide provides an overview of specialized topics and functionalities "
"within {productname}."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືຫົວນີ້ໃຫ້ພາບລວມຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ສະເພາະທາງ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/specialized-guides-overview.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/specialized-guides-overview.adoc:19
msgid ""
"It is designed to help users with basic, routine, and advanced tasks, "
"explaining each step's purpose and outlining the various options available "
"to customize your approach."
